rulings: ["[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact or enchantment. Older cards of type summon are also creature spells.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "A creature that\'s more than one of the five types gets +1/+1 only once from Kaheera\'s last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Creature cards in your deck may be a mix of the five creature types that Kaheera cares about. They may also have additional types, as long as each creature card is at least one of those five. Noncreature cards may have any subtypes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Once you put your companion into your hand, it behaves like any other card you’ve brought into the game. For example, if it’s countered or destroyed, it’s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "A generic mana cost is usually represented by numeric mana symbols ({1}, {2}, and so on) and also {X}. It is any cost requiring mana where that cost isn\'t {C}, {W}, {U}, {B}, {R}, or {G}."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Jegantha\'s companion ability compares the exact symbols in the mana costs of cards in your deck. If any one card has the same symbol twice, such as {X}{X}{R} or {R/G}{R/G}, the companion condition isn\'t satisfied."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Once you put your companion into your hand, it behaves like any other card you’ve brought into the game. For example, if it’s countered or destroyed, it’s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-04-14\', \'text\': \'You can spend mana from Jegantha’s mana ability to pay for a hybrid symbol such as {2}{W}, but only if you choose to pay the colored mana component, not the generic mana component.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Activated abilities contain a colon. They\'re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities (such as cycling) and will have colons in their reminder text."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Activating Zirda\'s last ability after a creature has blocked won\'t remove the blocking creature from combat or cause the creature it blocked to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Effects that reduce the generic mana cost of an activation cost can\'t reduce that cost\'s colored mana requirements. The activation cost is reduced by only {1} if doing so reduces that cost to one mana. For example, a cycling cost of {2} would become {1}, and one of {1}{R} would become {R}. The activation cost is unaffected if it already costs one or zero mana (such as the activation cost of Zirda\'s last ability)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Permanent cards are artifact, creature, enchantment, land, and planeswalker cards. Land cards with basic land types have intrinsic activated mana abilities associated with those types.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "As long as Crystalline Giant doesn\'t have all ten of the listed counters on it, you\'ll put one on it at the beginning of combat on your turn. If it has all ten kinds, the ability will trigger but you won\'t put any counter on it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If Crystalline Giant has one of the listed keywords but not because of a counter of that kind, that kind of counter is still eligible to be chosen at random.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You choose a kind of counter at random and put it on Crystalline Giant all while its ability is resolving. Players can\'t take actions between the time the choice is made and the time Crystalline Giant has the counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanents will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanents will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanents will cease to exist. Once the exiled permanents return, they\'re considered new objects with no relation to the objects that they were."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You can\'t exile permanents you control but don\'t own, or permanents that you own but don\'t control."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You choose which permanents to exile as Yorion\'s triggered ability resolves. No player may take action between the time you choose the permanents and the time they\'re exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Your minimum deck size is forty cards for Limited events (such as Booster Draft and Sealed Deck) and sixty cards for Constructed events (such as Standard or casual freeform play). Certain variants may have other minimums. The Commander variant requires exactly one hundred cards, so Yorion can never be your chosen companion in a Commander game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Once you put your companion into your hand, it behaves like any other card you’ve brought into the game. For example, if it’s countered or destroyed, it’s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a legendary Human you control may become lethal if General\'s Enforcer leaves the battlefield during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Only creatures are Humans. Planeswalkers such as Lukka and Narset who represent human characters aren\'t affected by General\'s Enforcer."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value. For example, if a permanent spell costs {X}{W}, you could cast it with X as 1 but not as 2."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s deck has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If a permanent card is put into your graveyard during your main phase and the stack is empty, you have a chance to cast it before any player may attempt to remove that card from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell from your graveyard using another permission, Lurrus\'s effect doesn\'t apply. You can cast another permanent spell from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If you cast one permanent spell from your graveyard and then have a new Lurrus come under your control in the same turn, you may cast another permanent spell from your graveyard that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Lurrus doesn\'t care about instant and sorcery cards in your starting deck. They may have any mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Lurrus doesn\'t let you play lands from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you begin to cast the spell, losing control of Lurrus won\'t affect the spell. You can finish casting it as normal."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the spell you cast from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You must pay the costs to cast that spell. If it has an alternative cost, such as a mutate cost, you may cast it for that cost instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Once you put your companion into your hand, it behaves like any other card you’ve brought into the game. For example, if it’s countered or destroyed, it’s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value. If a permanent or card in any other zone has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If a creature with trample you control would deal combat damage to a blocking creature while you control Obosh, you must assign its unmodified damage. For example, a 3/3 creature with trample blocked by a 2/2 creature can have 1 damage assigned to the defending player. It will then deal 4 damage to the blocking creature and 2 damage to the defending player.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If an effect such as that of Ravenous Gigantotherium asks you to divide damage among targets, you must divide the unmodified damage before doubling it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If multiple replacement or prevention effects try to modify damage that would be dealt to a permanent or player, the player or the controller of the permanent chooses the order in which they apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Once you put your companion into your hand, it behaves like any other card you’ve brought into the game. For example, if it’s countered or destroyed, it’s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-04-14\', \'text\': \'The damage is dealt by the same source as the original source of damage. The doubled damage isn’t dealt by Obosh unless it was the original source of damage.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s deck or a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The mana value of a token that isn\'t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Once you put your companion into your hand, it behaves like any other card you’ve brought into the game. For example, if it’s countered or destroyed, it’s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Mythos of Vadrok), the division can\'t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy will have the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can\'t be chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Lutri\'s ability can copy any instant or sorcery spell you control, not just one with targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The controller of a copy can\'t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The copy is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger. It will resolve before the original spell does."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Once you put your companion into your hand, it behaves like any other card you’ve brought into the game. For example, if it’s countered or destroyed, it’s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a creature you control with trample is unblocked, the full amount of combat damage it deals to the defending player is counted by Quartzwood Crasher\'s last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Quartzwood Crasher\'s second ability includes damage dealt by Quartzwood Crasher itself as long as it still has trample."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the greatest power among creatures on the battlefield is shared by a creature you control and a creature you don\'t control, you draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you control no creatures, you do nothing as Primal Empathy\'s ability resolves. If there are no creatures on the battlefield at all, you don\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with the greatest power, you choose which creature gets a +1/+1 counter while the ability is resolving. Players can\'t take actions in between the time you make this choice and the time that creature has a +1/+1 counter."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You determine whether you draw a card or put a +1/+1 counter only as Primal Empathy\'s triggered ability begins resolving. Players may respond to the ability to try to change which happens."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re activating the last ability of Bonders\' Enclave, no player may take actions until you\'ve finished activating it. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated the last ability of Bonders\' Enclave, it doesn\'t check again at any point whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Reconnaissance Mission\'s triggered ability triggers for each creature you control that deals combat damage to a player. You may draw one card each time the ability resolves, no matter how much damage was dealt."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'+1/+1 counters on The Ozolith have no effect unless it becomes a creature. Keyword counters on The Ozolith will grant it keywords that may have no practical effect. For example, flying on a noncreature artifact is just strange, but hexproof on a noncreature artifact is entirely useful.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "As The Ozolith\'s last ability resolves, you choose whether to move the counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If The Ozolith leaves the battlefield after the last ability triggers but before it resolves, you can\'t move any counters from it onto the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time The Ozolith\'s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. You won\'t remove any counters from The Ozolith."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The Ozolith\'s first ability doesn\'t move counters off the creature that\'s left the battlefield. Rather, you put the same number of each kind of counter the creature had onto The Ozoloith. Notably, if you somehow control a second The Ozolith, each one will receive the same number and kinds of counters that were on the creature that left the battlefield. Similarly, if the creature has an ability that triggers when it leaves the battlefield that refers to the number of counters it had, that ability will use the number of counters that were on the permanent, even if The Ozolith\'s first ability resolves first."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You can\'t move only some of the counters from The Ozolith onto the target creature."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'A card with mana value 0 has an even mana value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a replacement effect causes a player to exile the top four cards of their library instead of putting them into their graveyard as Gyruda\'s triggered ability resolves, the creature card you choose may be one of those cards in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Once you put your companion into your hand, it behaves like any other card you’ve brought into the game. For example, if it’s countered or destroyed, it’s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with 0 power isn’t destroyed unless it has at least 1 damage marked on it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with 0 toughness is put into its owner’s graveyard. This state-based action isn’t a consequence of damage, so Zilortha doesn’t affect it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Any time the game is checking whether damage is lethal or if a creature should be destroyed for having lethal damage marked on it, use the power of your creatures rather than their toughness to check the damage against. This includes being assigned trample damage, damage from Flame Spill, and so on.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature you control may become lethal if Zilortha enters or leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A monocolored card is exactly one of white, blue, black, red, or green and no other colors. A colorless card isn’t monocolored.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Emergent Ultimatum is still on the stack while you cast the cards you found, so those spells could target it. However, once it’s exiled, it will no longer be a legal target.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you find only one card, you’ll shuffle it into your library and exile Emergent Ultimatum without casting anything.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you wish to cast any exiled cards, you do so as part of the resolution of Emergent Ultimatum. You can’t wait to cast them later. Timing permissions based on a card’s type are ignored.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'A nonland permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Any land, instant, and sorcery cards exiled this way remain in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura\'s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it enters the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent\'s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura\'s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can\'t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Illuna\'s last ability exiles the cards face up. All players will see what the card is if you put it into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to put the card into your hand or onto the battlefield after seeing what the card is.\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An Aura being put onto the battlefield this way can’t enchant anything else that is being put onto the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it enters the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You choose which permanent cards to return while Eerie Ultimatum is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose and the time those cards return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You may choose to return just one permanent card, regardless of its name.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because Mythos of Brokkos doesn’t target the permanent cards in your graveyard, you may choose the card you searched for.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can’t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can’t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect copies the Mythos spell, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the copy won’t receive the bonus.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The abilities of the Mythos check what colors of mana were spent to cast the spell. It’s not an alternative cost to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The ability checks what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn’t otherwise spend, but it doesn’t change what mana you spent to cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A spell or ability that counters spells can still target spells with flash you cast. When that spell or ability resolves, your spell won’t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Cunning Nightbonder’s cost reduction applies only to generic mana in a spell’s cost. It can’t reduce a spell’s colored mana requirements. For example, your first Cunning Nightbonder won’t normally reduce the cost of your second since it has no generic mana in its cost.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Cunning Nightbonder’s last ability doesn’t apply to itself while it’s a spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Cunning Nightbonder enters the battlefield while a spell with flash that you cast is on the stack, that spell can’t be countered, even though you don’t get the {1} discount.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Players can’t attempt to remove Cunning Nightbonder to raise the cost of a spell you wish to cast, but they can remove it to allow their spells and abilities to counter your spells.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Spells with flash that you control but didn’t cast (perhaps because they’re copies of a spell or because you took control of them from another player) can be countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Cunning Nightbonder). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A spell that can’t be countered is a legal target for Keep Safe. That spell won’t be countered when Keep Safe resolves, but you’ll still draw a card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the permanent you control targeted by the target spell leaves the battlefield, that spell is no longer a legal target for Keep Safe. On the other hand, if that target permanent becomes an illegal target for the target spell but remains on the battlefield under your control, the target spell is still a legal target for Keep Safe.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Keep Safe can target a spell that has multiple targets, as long as at least one of those targets is a permanent you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected by Mythos of Vadrok.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Each chosen target must receive at least 1 damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can’t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can’t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect copies the Mythos spell, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the copy won’t receive the bonus.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If some of the targets become illegal for Mythos of Vadrok, the original division of damage still applies, but the damage that would have been dealt to illegal targets isn’t dealt at all.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The abilities of the Mythos check what colors of mana were spent to cast the spell. It’s not an alternative cost to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The ability checks what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn’t otherwise spend, but it doesn’t change what mana you spent to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The target creatures and planeswalkers will be unable to attack, block, or have their abilities activated even if the damage that would be dealt to them is prevented. However, if one of those permanents becomes an illegal target, it will be able to attack, block, and have its abilities activated.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'After activating Vivien’s last loyalty ability, the delayed triggered ability it creates will put a creature card onto the battlefield before the creature spell that caused the ability to trigger resolves.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s converted mana cost.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can’t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast the top card of your library, you can’t look at the next one until you’re done paying for that spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you cast a mutating creature spell, you must choose a target for it before the triggered ability from Vivien’s last ability puts a creature onto the battlefield. The creature you find can’t be the target of the mutating creature spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Normally, Vivien allows you to cast the top card of your library if it’s a creature card, it’s your main phase, and the stack is empty. If that creature card has flash, you’ll be able to cast it any time you could cast an instant, even on an opponent’s turn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Vivien lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction; see below), even if you don’t have priority. This action doesn’t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for that spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs such as mutate costs.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Although the Human is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won’t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Any effects that say that the Human can’t attack (such as that of Propaganda, or if you get a Human with defender) affect only the declaration of attackers. They won’t stop the Human you find from entering the battlefield attacking.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If more than one non-Human creature you control attacks, Winota’s ability triggers separately for each of them. For example, if three non-Human creatures attack, you won’t look at the top eighteen cards of your library at once; you’ll look at six, finish resolving the ability, and then repeat the process twice more as the other instances of the ability resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You choose which player or planeswalker the Human is attacking. It doesn’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that the non-Human creature is attacking.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An Aura being put onto the battlefield this way can’t enchant anything else that is being put onto the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Any abilities that trigger as the permanents enter the battlefield this way won’t be put onto the stack until after Genesis Ultimatum has finished resolving and is in exile.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it enters the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can choose to not put a permanent card onto the battlefield this way. You’ll put it into your hand without revealing it and without saying whether it was a permanent card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An Aura being put onto the battlefield this way can’t enchant anything else that is being put onto the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Any cards that you exile but don’t put on the battlefield for any reason (for example, because the card is an instant card or an Aura that can’t enchant anything) remain in exile.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Auspicious Starrix’s effect doesn’t count as playing lands. It can put land cards onto the battlefield even if it’s not your turn or if you’ve already played your land for the turn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it enters the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can’t legally be attached to anything, it remains in its current zone.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If there are fewer than X permanent cards in your library, you exile your entire library and put the permanent cards in it onto the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren\'t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won\'t affect them."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You can choose 0 as the value of X in Shark Typhoon\'s cycling cost. The last ability will trigger, and you\'ll create a 0/0 blue Shark creature token with flying. Unless something else is raising its toughness, the Shark will then immediately die."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won\'t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because it’s a loyalty ability, Narset’s first ability isn’t a mana ability. It can be activated only any time you could cast a sorcery. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a card you discard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Narset’s second ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you draw a card and may choose to discard a card. When you discard a nonland card this way, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and you pick a target to be dealt damage. This is different from effects that say “If you do . . .” in that you choose a target after looking at the card you draw and players can respond to the reflexive triggered ability knowing how much damage will be dealt.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The emblem created by Narset’s last ability is colorless. The damage it deals is from a colorless source.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can discard a card even if Narset leaves the battlefield before her middle ability resolves. The reflexive triggered ability will still trigger if you discard a nonland card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Effects that reduce the generic mana cost of a spell (such as that of Pollywog Symbiote) can’t reduce that spell’s colored mana requirements.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Pollywog Symbiote’s first ability applies to creature spells you cast that have mutate even if you don’t cast them for their mutate cost. Similarly, its second ability triggers even if the creature spell with mutate was cast for a cost other than its mutate cost.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You draw a card and discard a card all while Pollywog Symbiote’s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast a spell “as though” it has flash, Slitherwisp’s last ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Slitherwisp’s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you to draw one card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Blisterspit Gremlin’s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the first triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Song of Creation’s first ability is cumulative if you control more than one. It’s also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Dryad of the Ilysian Grove.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Song of Creation’s second ability doesn’t trigger when you cast it because it’s not on the battlefield yet.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An opponent’s spell that targets a single creature with flying you control more than once costs only {2} more to cast. An opponent’s spell that targets multiple creatures with flying you control costs {2} more for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Jubilant Skybonder’s last ability applies to itself as long as it still has flying.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Any effects that modify the Human’s power and/or toughness without setting them to a specific number or value will apply after its base power and toughness are set, regardless of the order in which those effects were created. The same is true of counters that modify its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Exuberant Wolfbear’s power and toughness are unaffected when the target Human takes on those values.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Exuberant Wolfbear leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, use its power and toughness as it last existed on the battlefield to determine the Human’s new base power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The Human’s new base power and toughness are set to Exuberant Wolfbear’s actual power and toughness, not just its base power and toughness. If Exuberant Wolfbear’s power or toughness changes later in the turn, the Human isn’t affected.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You choose whether the Human’s base power and toughness change as the ability resolves, not as the ability is put onto the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied permanent will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “As [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[This permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied permanent will also work.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an Aura is put onto the battlefield without being cast, such as by being created as a token, the Aura’s controller-to-be chooses what it will enchant as it enters the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn’t target anything (so it could be attached to an opponent’s permanent with hexproof, for example), but the Aura’s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If an Aura token can’t legally be attached to anything, it isn’t created.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can’t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can’t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect copies the Mythos spell, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the copy won’t receive the bonus.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the copied permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the copied permanent is copying something else, the token enters the battlefield as whatever that permanent is copying.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the copied permanent is itself a token, the token created by Mythos of Illuna copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target or if the token is no longer a creature when the token’s granted ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. If it’s a legal target but the token is no longer on the battlefield when the ability resolves, the target creature won’t deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the token isn’t a creature immediately after it enters the battlefield, the granted ability won’t trigger. You can’t take actions to make that token into a creature after it has entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If {R}{G} was spent to cast the spell, the token has the extra ability. If something copies the token later, the copy will also have that ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The abilities of the Mythos check what colors of mana were spent to cast the spell. It’s not an alternative cost to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The ability checks what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn’t otherwise spend, but it doesn’t change what mana you spent to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what is printed on the permanent and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that permanent is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Archipelagore’s triggered ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, planeswalker, and sorcery are card types. Supertypes (such as legendary) and subtypes (such as Giant) are not.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the cycled card has multiple card types, you stop when you exile a card that shares any of those types. You don’t exile card to find one that shares all of its types, and you can’t choose to keep going to find a different one of those types.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Swallow Whole, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you exile your entire library without exiling a card that shares a card type, you put the library back in a random order and continue. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you wish to cast the last exiled card, you do so as part of the resolution of the cycling ability. You can’t wait to cast it later. Timing permissions based on a card’s type are ignored.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, planeswalker, and sorcery are card types. Supertypes (such as legendary) and subtypes (such as Ooze) are not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Before shuffling your deck to become your library, you may reveal one card from outside the game to be your companion if your starting deck meets the requirements of the companion ability. You can\'t reveal more than one. It remains revealed outside the game as the game begins."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Effects that reduce the generic mana cost of a spell (such as that of Umori) can\'t reduce that spell\'s colored mana requirements."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If more than one player wishes to reveal a companion, the starting player does so first, and players proceed in turn order. Once a player has chosen not to reveal a companion, that player can\'t change their mind."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discard, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Land cards in your deck may have any number of additional types that may be shared with other cards or not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion ability has no effect if the card is in your starting deck and creates no restriction on putting a card with a companion ability into your starting deck. For example, Zirda may be in your starting deck even if your other permanent cards don\'t all have activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The companion\'s other abilities apply only if the creature is on the battlefield. They have no effect while the companion is outside the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The requirements of the companion ability apply only to your starting deck. They do not apply to your sideboard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "To satisfy Umori\'s companion requirement, there must be one card type that each nonland card in your starting deck has. For example, if every nonland card is an artifact creature, enchantment creature, or creature, it is satisfied; but if you have an artifact creature, an artifact, and a creature, it is not satisfied."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may have one companion in the Commander variant. Your deck, including your commander, must meet its companion requirement. Your companion is not one of your one hundred cards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Your companion begins the game outside the game. In tournament play, this means your sideboard. In casual play, it\'s simply a card you own that\'s not in your starting deck."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "If you reveal a companion outside the game, for as long as it remains there, you may pay {3} any time you could cast a sorcery (that is, you have priority during your main phase and the stack is empty). Once you do, you put it into your hand and behaves like any other card you\'ve brought into the game. For example, if it\'s discarded, countered, or destroyed, it\'s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game. This is a change from previous rules."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Once you put your companion into your hand, it behaves like any other card you’ve brought into the game. For example, if it’s countered or destroyed, it’s put into your graveyard, remaining in the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': "Paying {3} to put your companion into your hand is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and players can\'t respond to it. Once you take this action, you may cast that card if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take actions."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-01\', \'text\': \'Wizards of the Coast has issued functional errata for the Companion mechanic. Instead of casting companions from outside the game: Once per game, any time you could cast a sorcery (during your main phase when the stack is empty), you can pay {3} to put your companion from your sideboard into your hand. This is a special action, not an activated ability. It happens immediately and can’t be responded to. It can’t be countered or stopped by cards like Phyrexian Revoker. For more information please see https://magic.wizards.com/en/articles/archive/news/june-1-2020-banned-and-restricted-announcement\'}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'As Charge of the Forever-Beast resolves, it deals damage based on the revealed card’s power if it’s still in your hand. If that card has left your hand, Charge of the Forever-Beast deals damage based on the card’s power immediately before it left your hand.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You must reveal exactly one card to cast Charge of the Forever-Beast; you can’t cast it without revealing a card, and you can’t reveal additional cards. The revealed card remains revealed until Charge of the Forever-Beast resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'As Mythos of Snapdax resolves, first you choose which permanents you control won’t be sacrificed, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then each nonland permanent not chosen is sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can’t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can’t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect copies the Mythos spell, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the copy won’t receive the bonus.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you control a permanent with more than one type, you may choose it for each of those types. For example, you could choose an artifact creature as the artifact you keep and also as the creature you keep.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you’re choosing the permanents for each player, your choices must still be legal. For example, you can’t decline to choose a creature a player will keep if that player controls a creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Lands with another permanent type can’t be chosen and won’t be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The abilities of the Mythos check what colors of mana were spent to cast the spell. It’s not an alternative cost to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The ability checks what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn’t otherwise spend, but it doesn’t change what mana you spent to cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'As the triggered ability resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other opponent in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'As the triggered ability resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses a creature they control, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'As you cast Back for More, it targets only a creature card in your graveyard. While the spell is resolving, you return the target card to the battlefield. When you do, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and you pick a target to fight. This is different from effects that say “If you do . . .” in that you can return a creature card to the battlefield without a legal target to fight.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when the reflexive triggered ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. If the creature you put onto the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield or no longer a creature, the target creature won’t deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The reflexive triggered ability from Back for More is put onto the stack at the same time as any other triggered abilities caused by the creature entering the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Fiend Artisan may become lethal if creature cards leave your graveyard during that turn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Fiend Artisan’s first ability applies only while it’s on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Skycat Sovereign may become lethal if other creatures with flying you control leave the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Skycat Sovereign’s first ability applies only while it’s on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Human you control may become lethal if General Kudro leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'General Kudro can be sacrificed to pay the cost of its own last ability. How noble.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Only creatures are Humans. Planeswalkers such as Lukka and Narset who represent human characters won’t cause General Kudro’s middle ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Human you control may become lethal if Sanctuary Lockdown leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Since Sanctuary Lockdown’s activated ability doesn’t have a tap symbol in its cost, you can tap creatures that haven’t been under your control since your most recent turn began to pay the cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to the target creature may become lethal once its base toughness becomes 4.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Effects that modify the affected creature’s power or toughness without setting it will apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Startling Development overwrites all previous effects that set the affected creatures’ color, creature types, power, and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set these characteristics to specific values that start to apply after Startling Development resolves will overwrite that part of the effect.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The affected creature doesn’t lose any abilities when it becomes a Serpent.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because the triggered ability doesn’t target the creature card in your graveyard, you may choose one of the two cards you put there from your library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Death’s Oasis becomes a creature, activating its last ability will cause its first ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature on the battlefield or a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Use the converted mana cost of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield and the converted mana cost of the creature card as it exists in your graveyard to determine which cards may be returned to your hand. This may result in a creature’s death bringing itself back to your hand; perhaps it was one card of a merged creature, or it had become a copy of a more expensive creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Blitz Leech’s ability removes all counters from the target creature before state-based actions are checked to see if that creature should die. For example, a 2/2 creature with a flying counter on it will lose that counter while it’s a 0/0 creature before it dies.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Blitz of the Thunder-Raptor is still on the stack while you determine how much damage is dealt. It isn’t in your graveyard to contribute to that amount of damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Blitz of the Thunder-Raptor’s replacement effect will exile the target creature or planeswalker if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage. It applies to the target creature or planeswalker even if Blitz of the Thunder-Raptor deals no damage to it (most likely because you have no instant or sorcery cards in your graveyard).'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Blood Curdle targets only one creature: the one that will be destroyed. You choose which creature to put a menace counter on after the target creature has been destroyed.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature you control was exiled until the creature that was destroyed left the battlefield, the exiled creature returns in time to receive the counter.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Blood Curdle tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t put a menace counter on any creature. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do put a menace counter on a creature you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Casting Brokkos with the permission granted by its last ability doesn’t change when you can cast it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If another effect gives you permission to cast Brokkos from your graveyard, you may cast it for any cost associated with that permission.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you cast Brokkos with the permission granted by its last ability, you must pay its mutate cost to cast it. You can’t choose to pay its mana cost or another alternative cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Chevill’s middle ability and last ability look for any bounty counter on your opponents’ permanents, not just one from that Chevill. For example, if players A and B each control a Chevill and player A has put a bounty counter on player C’s creature, player B’s Chevill won’t put a counter on anything and both players will gain 3 life and draw a card when that creature dies.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Chevill leaves the battlefield at the same time that an opponent’s permanent with a bounty counter on it dies, you gain 3 life and draw a card. If Chevill leaves the battlefield before that permanent dies, Chevill’s last ability won’t be around to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the creature or planeswalker with a bounty counter on it ceases to be a creature or planeswalker, Chevill’s last ability will still trigger if that permanent is put into a graveyard from the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that a creature with a bounty counter on it is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before the last ability goes on the stack.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Clash of Titans can target two creatures controlled by the same player.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Clash of Titans tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Colossification can be attached to a creature that’s already tapped. Its middle ability won’t have any effect, but its last ability certainly will.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Creatures other than the second target creature may still block the first target creature if able.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature is required to block a creature with menace, another creature must also block that creature if able. If none can, the creature that’s required to block can block another creature or not block at all.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the second target creature can’t block the first target creature for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn’t block. If there’s a cost associated with having it block the creature, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to block in that case either. That creature is free to block another creature or to not block at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Effects may put cards from other zones onto the battlefield under an opponent’s control.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a rule or effect allows them to do so, your opponents may play lands from zones other than their hand and activate abilities of cards in zones other than their hand.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect says that an opponent may cast a spell from anywhere other than their hand, Drannith Magistrate’s restriction overrules that permission.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Escape Protocol’s triggered ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you may pay {1}. If you do, a second ability triggers and you pick a target artifact or creature you control. This is different from abilities that say “If you do . . .” in that players may cast spells and activate abilities after mana is paid but before the target changes zones.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled. Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'While resolving Escape Protocol’s triggered ability, you can’t pay {1} multiple times to exile multiple permanents you control.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Excess damage caused by a spell or ability is similar to how combat damage from a creature with trample is handled. Start with the amount of damage being dealt to the creature and determine what is “lethal.” This is the creature’s toughness minus the amount of damage that it already has marked on it, but ignoring any replacement or prevention effects that will modify this damage. Also ignore whether the creature has an ability such as indestructible that will result in it not being destroyed by this damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If either creature is an illegal target as Ram Through tries to resolve, the creature you control won’t deal damage to any creature or player.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature you control has deathtouch, 1 damage from it is lethal.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you’ve determined how much damage is excess, the creature you control simultaneously deals damage to the creature and to its controller. This damage may be modified by replacement or prevention effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Excess damage caused by a spell or ability is similar to how combat damage from a creature with trample is handled. Start with the amount of damage being dealt to the creature and determine what is “lethal.” This is the creature’s toughness minus the amount of damage that it already has marked on it, but ignoring any replacement or prevention effects that will modify this damage. Also ignore whether the creature has an ability such as indestructible that will result in it not being destroyed by this damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Flame Spill tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. It won’t deal damage to any player.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you’ve determined how much damage is excess, Flame Spill simultaneously deals damage to the creature and to its controller. This damage may be modified by replacement or prevention effects.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'For each creature card exiled with Lukka’s first ability, you can cast it as long as you control any Lukka planeswalker, not just the one that exiled the card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature card in a player’s library or a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you reveal your entire library without revealing a creature card with higher converted mana cost, you put the library back in a random order and continue.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Lukka’s last ability causes the opposing team to lose twice as much life as the power of your creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you begin to cast an exiled card, losing control of Lukka won’t affect the spell. You can finish casting it as normal.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The ability granted by Lukka’s first ability doesn’t change when you may cast the card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You may cast creature cards exiled with Lukka’s first ability as noncreature spells if a rule or effect allows you to do so. For example, adventurer cards from the Throne of Eldraine set may be cast as Adventures.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You still pay any costs for spells cast from Lukka’s first ability. You may pay alternative costs, such as mutate costs.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell’s converted mana cost. If a permanent or card in any other zone has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Lavabrink Venturer somehow has no choice made for its ability, its last ability grants it no protection abilities.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a token that isn’t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same converted mana cost as that object.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You choose odd or even for Lavabrink Venturer before it enters the battlefield. There’s no point at which players can target it before it has gained the appropriate protection abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Frondland Felidar’s last ability applies to itself as long as it still has vigilance.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you’ve activated the ability granted by Frondland Felidar, causing the creature to lose that ability (such as by removing Frondland Felidar from the battlefield) won’t affect the ability on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Tapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can activate the ability granted by Frondland Felidar after attacking but before blockers are chosen.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Frost Lynx’s triggered ability can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Frostveil Ambush can target a creature that’s already tapped. That creature won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Gust of Wind is unaffected if you no longer control a creature with flying after you’ve cast it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target nonland permanent is an illegal target by the time Gust of Wind tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Gust of Wind, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can’t try to change whether you control a creature with flying.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Gust of Wind). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Huntmaster Liger’s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +X/+X.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as the triggered ability resolves. Once that happens, the value of X won’t change later in the turn even if Huntmaster Liger mutates again, although in that case the creatures will receive a second, larger +X/+X in addition to the one generated by the ability’s earlier resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Bristling Boar gains menace, it can’t be blocked at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Essence Symbiote mutates, its ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You gain 2 life when Essence Symbiote’s ability resolves, even if you can’t put a +1/+1 counter on the mutated creature (most likely because it’s left the battlefield).'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Luminous Broodmoth dies after losing flying but not losing its triggered ability, its ability will trigger for itself.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Luminous Broodmoth dies at the same time as a creature without flying, its ability triggers for that creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a merged creature dies and that creature didn’t have flying, each card that was part of that merged creature is returned to the battlefield. Each one has a flying counter on it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Luminous Broodmoth’s ability triggers if a token creature without flying dies, but the token won’t be returned to the battlefield. If that token was a merged creature, any cards that were part of it will be returned to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Spelleater Wolverine loses double strike after it deals first-strike damage, it won’t deal regular combat damage. If it gains double strike after other creatures have dealt first-strike damage, it won’t deal first-strike damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you return no creature cards to the battlefield, you won’t put any counters on any creatures.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you return two creature cards, you may put one counter on each or put both counters on one.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You could target a single creature card with Call of the Death-Dweller. In this case, you’ll put both counters on that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature has power and toughness written as */* with an ability that defines its power and toughness, its base power and toughness become 0/0 when it loses all abilities. Mystic Subdual then makes it a -2/0. If its power and toughness are written as */*+1, it’s -2/1, and so on.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the affected creature gains an ability after Mystic Subdual becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Mutating the enchanted creature won’t cause it to gain abilities. This is because mutate modifies the creature’s base characteristics, while Mystic Subdual applies to the resulting creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature is attacking a planeswalker, the planeswalker’s controller is the defending player.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Labyrinth Raptor’s second and third abilities apply to itself as long as it still has menace.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The defending player sacrifices a blocking creature before combat damage is dealt. This may cause a single creature to be blocking the creature with menace; the blocking creature remains blocking. It will still deal and be dealt combat damage as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a token that isn’t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You choose odd or even while Extinction Event is resolving. Players can’t take any actions between the time you make that choice and the time some creatures go extinct.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Swallow Whole, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you wish to cast the target card, you do so as part of the resolution of Vadrok’s ability. You can’t wait to cast it later. Timing permissions based on a card’s type are ignored.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it’s not a card drawn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to cast a spell without paying its mana cost, you can’t choose to cast it and pay unless another rule or effect allows you to cast that spell for a cost. Similarly, you can’t waive a cost reduction unless that effect says you may.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect copies the Mythos spell, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the copy won’t receive the bonus.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Mythos of Nethroi can target any nonland permanent. Determine as the spell resolves whether the permanent is destroyed, either because it’s a creature at that time or because {G}{W} was spent to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The abilities of the Mythos check what colors of mana were spent to cast the spell. It’s not an alternative cost to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The ability checks what mana was actually spent to cast a spell. If an effect allows you to spend mana “as though it were mana” of any color or type, that allows you to spend mana you couldn’t otherwise spend, but it doesn’t change what mana you spent to cast the spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect copies Swallow Whole, the copy will put a +1/+1 counter on the creature tapped to pay the additional cost of the original spell.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Swallow Whole tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t put a +1/+1 counter on any creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The target tapped creature will be exiled even if the creature you tapped leaves the battlefield or becomes untapped before Swallow Whole resolves.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control, including a creature you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the additional cost.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You must tap exactly one creature to cast Swallow Whole; you can’t cast it without tapping a creature, and you can’t tap additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If damage that can be prevented is dealt to Stormwild Capridor at the same time as damage that can’t be prevented, it gets +1/+1 counters for the prevented damage before checking to see if it dies from the damage that couldn’t be prevented.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If damage that can’t be prevented is dealt to Stormwild Capridor, it doesn’t get +1/+1 counters for that damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If multiple replacement or prevention effects try to modify damage that would be dealt to a creature, the controller of the creature chooses the order in which they apply.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If either target becomes illegal before Inspired Ultimatum resolves, the other will be affected as appropriate and you’ll draw five cards. If both targets become illegal, the spell won’t resolve and you won’t draw five cards.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can target yourself as the player to gain 5 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Go for Blood resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If one of Channeled Force’s two targets becomes illegal, the other is still affected as appropriate.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you cast Channeled Force without paying its mana cost, you still choose a value for X and discard that many cards. This is because the spell doesn’t have {X} in its mana cost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If one or more creatures you control die at the same time that Bastion of Remembrance leaves the battlefield, its last ability triggers for each of those creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that creatures you control are dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before the last ability goes on the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Bastion of Remembrance\'s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you to gain 1 life."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it’s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics it specifically modifies. It doesn’t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The token’s power and toughness are 1/1. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy. If the copied card has an ability that defines its power or toughness, that ability isn’t copied. On the other hand, gaining haste after the token has been created is not a copiable value.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Zenith Flare tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t gain X life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the first time you discard cards during your turn is due to having too many cards in hand during your cleanup step, you’ll draw that many cards. Players will receive priority during the cleanup step in this case, and a new cleanup step will happen after that one, during which you may have to discard cards again.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you discard a card as a cost to cast a spell or activate an ability, Rielle’s triggered ability resolves before that spell or ability but after you’ve chosen targets for it. If you discard a card while a spell or ability is resolving, that spell or ability finishes resolving before Rielle’s triggered ability does.’'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Rielle’s first ability applies only while it’s on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If the power of the target creature cards change while in your graveyard, most likely because one has a characteristic-defining ability that defines a * in its power, the total power of the creatures may become greater than 10. If this happens, the entire selection of targets is illegal and nothing is returned to the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Nethroi\'s triggered ability can return any combination of creatures whose powers total 10 or less. For example, it could target ten 1/1 creature cards, two 5/5 creature cards, and so on. Regardless of what other creature cards you choose as targets, you can also choose any number of creature cards with power 0 as targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Use the power of the creature cards as they exist in your graveyard to determine whether they can be the targets of Nethroi\'s triggered ability. For example, a 0/0 creature card that will enter the battlefield as a copy of a 15/15 creature can be returned, as can five 0/0 creature cards that will each enter the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on them."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target Human is an illegal target by the time Kogla’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. Kogla won’t gain indestructible.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when Kogla’s first ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. If it’s a legal target but Kogla is no longer on the battlefield when the ability resolves, the target creature won’t deal or be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Fire Prophecy tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve. You won’t have the option to put a card on the bottom of your library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'While resolving Fire Prophecy, you can’t put more than one card on the bottom of your library to draw more than one card.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Savai Thundermane’s reflexive triggered ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. You won’t gain 2 life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you pay {2} while Savai Thundermane’s triggered ability is resolving, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and will resolve separately. This is different from effects that say “If you do . . .” in that players may take actions after you’ve paid mana but before damage is dealt.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'While resolving Savai Thundermane’s triggered ability, you can’t pay {2} more than once to have it deal more damage or gain more life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can pay {2} even if Savai Thundermane leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves. The reflexive triggered ability will still trigger if you do.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target opponent controls no creatures, they won’t put a deathtouch counter on any creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The target opponent chooses which of their creatures receives a deathtouch counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the top card of your library is a land card, you may just put it into your hand instead of putting it onto the battlefield. If you do, you don’t reveal that it’s a land card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you don’t put the top card of your library onto the battlefield, you put it into your hand without revealing it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Parcelbeast’s effect doesn’t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you’ve already played your land for the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If there is no legal target for Snapdax’s triggered ability when it triggers, it won’t be put onto the stack at all and you won’t gain 4 life. Similarly, if the target creature or planeswalker is an illegal target by the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve and you won’t gain 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If two Phase Dolphins attack at the same time, their abilities can target each other.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The target creature can’t be blocked this turn even if Phase Dolphin leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you choose the first mode and the creature gains a counter in response, you can’t remove counters from it instead; the spell just doesn’t resolve. Similarly, if you choose the second mode and the creature loses its counters in response, you can’t destroy it instead.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you choose the second mode for Heartless Act, you choose which counters to remove from the creature, no matter who controls the creature. You may choose counters of different kinds.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you cycle Yidaro but it isn’t in your graveyard as the triggered ability resolves, you can’t put it onto the battlefield or shuffle it into your library. You’ll still shuffle your library if you haven’t cycled Yidaro four times this game.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You don’t have to cycle the same physical card four times for Yidaro to get tired of being cycled and stomp onto the battlefield. Any cards named Yidaro, Wandering Monster will count.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you don’t play the exiled card, it remains exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Rooting Moloch gives you permission to play the card as a land or cast it as a spell. You can’t cycle the exiled card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the exiled card. If it’s a land, you can’t play it unless you have land plays available.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You’ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you don’t put the card you look at into your graveyard, it remains on top of your library. You’ll draw it during your draw step unless something else moves it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Mana produced by Titans’ Nest can be used to cast a spell that has {X} in an additional or alternative cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you have fewer than three cards in your library, you put them all into your hand and none into your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Drannith Stinger’s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Insatiable Hemophage’s last ability causes the opposing team to lose life equal to twice the value of X and you to gain X life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Serrated Scorpion’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life and you to gain 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Kinnan doesn’t care about any restrictions or riders the nonland permanent put on the mana it produced. The additional mana Kinnan produces won’t have any restrictions or riders.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The additional mana is produced by Kinnan, not by the nonland permanent that you tapped for mana.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You’re “tapping a permanent for mana” only if you’re activating a mana ability of that permanent that includes the {T} symbol in its cost. A mana ability produces mana as part of its effect.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Mana produced by Humble Naturalist can be spent on any part of a creature spell’s total cost, including additional costs (such as kicker costs) and alternative costs (such as mutate costs). It can’t be spent to pay the costs of abilities of creatures you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Nightsquad Commando’s ability checks only whether you declared an attacking creature during the turn. It doesn’t trigger once for each such creature, and it doesn’t check whether any attacking creatures dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Of One Mind is unaffected if you no longer control a Human and non-Human creature after you’ve cast it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Of One Mind, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can’t try to change whether you control a Human and a non-Human creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Of One Mind). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once a creature blocks, it remains a blocking creature through the end of combat step, even if the attacking creature dies or leaves combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked Greater Sandwurm, changing the power of the blocking creature won’t cause Greater Sandwurm to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Mutual Destruction, players can’t try to remove your permanents with flash to make it lose flash until you’re done casting it. If it loses flash after it’s been cast, it will still resolve if able.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The last time that the game checks whether you have permission to cast a spell is before costs are paid. If you sacrifice a creature with flash to cast Mutual Destruction and then have no other permanents with flash, you’ll legally finish casting Mutual Destruction even though it no longer has flash. In this case, abilities that trigger whenever you cast a spell with flash won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you announce that you’re casting Tentative Connection, no player may take actions until the spell has been paid for. Notably, opponents can’t try to change whether you control a creature with menace.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Tentative Connection can target any creature, even one that you already control or that is already untapped.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Tentative Connection is unaffected if you no longer control a creature with menace after you’ve cast it. You won’t have to pay an additional {3}.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Tentative Connection). The converted mana cost of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Proud Wildbonder’s last ability applies to itself as long as it still has trample.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'When assigning combat damage, you choose whether you want to assign all damage to blocking creatures and assign trample damage from that as normal, or if you want to assign all of it to the player or planeswalker the creature is attacking. You can’t assign some damage to one blocker then skip other blockers.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can decide to assign combat damage to the defending player or planeswalker even if the blocking creature has protection from green or other damage prevention effects applying to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Regal Leosaur’s last ability affects only other creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +2/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Sleeper Dart’s second ability doesn’t tap the creature. It can target any creature, tapped or untapped. If that creature is already untapped at the beginning of its controller’s next untap step, the effect won’t do anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Solid Footing’s last ability doesn’t change the enchanted creature’s power; it changes only the amount of combat damage that creature assigns. All other rules and effects that check power or toughness use the actual values. For example, if a creature fights while enchanted by Solid Footing, that creature will deal damage equal to its power, not its toughness.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Sudden Spinnerets can target a creature that’s already untapped. It will still get +1/+3 and a reach counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Suffocating Fumes affects only creatures your opponents control at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won’t get -1/-1.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The number of creatures you control with vigilance is determined as Alert Heedbonder’s last ability resolves. If it’s still on the battlefield, the count will include Alert Heedbonder itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Use the exiled creature’s toughness as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life you lose.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Whether you control a Human is checked only after exiling the target creature. If that creature had exiled a Human you controlled until that creature left the battlefield, that Human will return to the battlefield in time to be counted.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Use the sacrificed creature’s toughness as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life you gain.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You draw only one card, no matter how much life you gain.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cast Voracious Greatshark without a target for its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability. That ability will simply not happen. It won’t cause Voracious Greatshark to counter itself. It’s not that hungry.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You draw a card and discard a card all while Facet Reader’s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Because discarding two cards is an additional cost, you can\'t cast Cathartic Reunion if you don\'t have at least two other cards in hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Although the targeted player doesn\'t need to find a basic land card if they don\'t want to, that player must shuffle their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Because Corpse Churn doesn\'t target the creature card in your graveyard, you may choose one of the three cards you put there from your library if applicable."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abenteuerlust\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Abenteuer ohne Gefährten ist kaum ein richtiges Abenteuer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc44bfdb-fe5e-41ab-bb41-f04de500b857\', \'multiverseId\': 479921}, \'multiverseid\': 479921}, {\'name\': \'Impulso aventurero\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de criatura o de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Una aventura sin un compañero no se puede considerar una aventura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4343fd46-7a5e-4c3f-a8f7-da1fb3682d87\', \'multiverseId\': 480180}, \'multiverseid\': 480180}, {\'name\': \'Impulsion audacieuse\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature ou de terrain parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Une aventure sans compagnon n\'est pas vraiment une aventure.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f225d59c-8d00-4782-b035-e2bd10da9c89\', \'multiverseId\': 480439}, \'multiverseid\': 480439}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Avventuroso\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta creatura o terra scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Un\'avventura senza un compagno non è degna di questo nome.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'914acc9c-f971-49c2-8bdd-9e4ec5cb70e9\', \'multiverseId\': 480698}, \'multiverseid\': 480698}, {\'name\': \'冒険の衝動\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。あなたはその中からクリーチャーか土地であるカード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'相棒のいない冒険は、冒険とは言い難い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46cef8fe-bcc1-4c05-b31e-6c6e2e83276a\', \'multiverseId\': 480957}, \'multiverseid\': 480957}, {\'name\': \'대담한 충동\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 생물 또는 대지 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'단짝과 함께하지 않는 모험은 모험이라고 부를 수 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73d53f59-268d-410c-a251-d8d7b1c8ba84\', \'multiverseId\': 481216}, \'multiverseid\': 481216}, {\'name\': \'Impulso Aventureiro\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de criatura ou terreno dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Uma aventura sem um companheiro não é uma aventura de verdade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c6e77d-a887-451c-a443-e3b64cba8bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 481475}, \'multiverseid\': 481475}, {\'name\': \'Зов Приключений\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту существа или земли и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Приключение без компаньона — вовсе не приключение.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2995e520-a7af-41e4-bcd2-e94bdab95aea\', \'multiverseId\': 481734}, \'multiverseid\': 481734}, {\'name\': \'冒险冲动\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。你可以展示其中的一张生物或地牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'没有行侣的冒险，就根本不能称为冒险。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb48f0f9-8f5a-4c11-a6ef-29e3b4f68f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 481993}, \'multiverseid\': 481993}, {\'name\': \'冒險衝動\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。你可以展示其中的一張生物或地牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'沒有行侶的冒險，就根本不能稱為冒險。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'839ead4a-3a0f-43d5-aa58-797ce8679e91\', \'multiverseId\': 482252}, \'multiverseid\': 482252}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgeriegelter Zufluchtsort\', \'text\': \'Menschen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{2}, tappe zwei ungetappte Menschen, die du kontrollierst: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Drannith hat keine Gnade mit Verrätern."\\n—General Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479807&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1bc058-9fe5-441a-aabf-5227540bc0dd\', \'multiverseId\': 479807}, \'multiverseid\': 479807}, {\'name\': \'Bloqueo del santuario\', \'text\': \'Los Humanos que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{2}, girar dos Humanos enderezados que controlas: Gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Drannith no perdona a los traidores".\\n—El general Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bc431d2-84f9-4524-b320-07d9f3c99d01\', \'multiverseId\': 480066}, \'multiverseid\': 480066}, {\'name\': \'Confinement dans le sanctuaire\', \'text\': "Les humains que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{2}, engagez deux humains dégagés que vous contrôlez : Engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Drannith ne fait pas de quartier aux traîtres. »\\n—Général Koudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480325&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'583ed42e-ef1d-4b88-88fc-5f7e5baaceef\', \'multiverseId\': 480325}, \'multiverseid\': 480325}, {\'name\': \'Sbarramento del Santuario\', \'text\': \'Gli Umani che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\n{2}, TAPpa due Umani STAPpati che controlli: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"A Drannith non c\\\'è spazio per i traditori."\\n—Generale Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2efdd46d-7e61-474f-94ee-4e594e64625b\', \'multiverseId\': 480584}, \'multiverseid\': 480584}, {\'name\': \'聖域封鎖\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている人間は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{2}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態の人間２体をタップする：対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「ドラニス人は裏切り者には容赦がない。」\\n――クードロ将軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfc2584a-0821-4c16-b3ba-7c183fbcce97\', \'multiverseId\': 480843}, \'multiverseid\': 480843}, {\'name\': \'성소 제재\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 인간들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n{2}, 당신이 조종하는 언탭된 인간 두 개를 탭한다: 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"드라니스에 변절자가 발붙일 곳은 없다."\\n—쿠드로 장군\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f79800-95a2-40d8-8f79-da69e1292b3d\', \'multiverseId\': 481102}, \'multiverseid\': 481102}, {\'name\': \'Isolamento do Santuário\', \'text\': \'Os Humanos que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\n{2}, vire dois Humanos desvirados que você controla: Vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Drannith não abriga traidores."\\n— General Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a96f6653-672c-4afe-83ff-b4f30d821a62\', \'multiverseId\': 481361}, \'multiverseid\': 481361}, {\'name\': \'Закрытое Убежище\', \'text\': \'Перманенты с подтипом Человек под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\n{2}, поверните два неповернутых перманента с подтипом Человек под вашим контролем: поверните целевое существо под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Драннит не дает пристанища предателям».\\n— генерал Кудро\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b663e693-d7a9-419a-9fed-c8fe5e2da878\', \'multiverseId\': 481620}, \'multiverseid\': 481620}, {\'name\': \'庇护地封锁\', \'text\': \'由你操控的人类得+1/+1。\\n{2}，横置两个由你操控且未横置的人类：横置目标由对手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「卓尼斯绝无叛徒容身之地。」\\n～寇卓将军\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65fa8004-83d3-4562-9ad7-fdb2b9d9b914\', \'multiverseId\': 481879}, \'multiverseid\': 481879}, {\'name\': \'庇護地封鎖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的人類得+1/+1。\\n{2}，橫置兩個由你操控且未橫置的人類：橫置目標由對手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「卓尼斯絕無叛徒容身之地。」\\n～寇卓將軍\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'650b7507-8a66-4a31-a29f-3a032870e885\', \'multiverseId\': 482138}, \'multiverseid\': 482138}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Aasfresser folgen im Schatten von Himmelstadt und laben sich an den Kadavern der Monster, die die schwebende Stadt angegriffen haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479948&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ef7be8-63b3-4d50-9b79-a78520127e2b\', \'multiverseId\': 479948}, \'multiverseid\': 479948}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Tras la estela de la sombra de Puertoaéreo hay carroñeros que devoran los restos de los monstruos que han atacado la ciudad flotante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b06f988-e67b-45aa-966d-545067af24c2\', \'multiverseId\': 480207}, \'multiverseid\': 480207}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les charognards suivent l\'ombre de Vogueciel, se nourrissant des carcasses des monstres qui attaquent la ville volante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'798534b3-576a-49d6-a0f3-58cb8e72c884\', \'multiverseId\': 480466}, \'multiverseid\': 480466}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "I saprofaghi seguono l\'ombra della Solcanembi, banchettando con le carcasse dei mostri che hanno attaccato la città fluttuante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c769bf3f-f884-48bb-a8ed-26e36c4a0438\', \'multiverseId\': 480725}, \'multiverseid\': 480725}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'死体あさりはスカイセイルの影についていく。浮遊都市を攻撃した怪物の死体を貪るためだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b02b6d5-c08b-4913-9b25-4fe1f98feb23\', \'multiverseId\': 480984}, \'multiverseid\': 480984}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'청소부들은 창공돛의 그림자를 따라가며 부유도시를 공격한 괴수들의 시체를 포식했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6e28052-a567-4af1-8431-a1b60afc1ae1\', \'multiverseId\': 481243}, \'multiverseid\': 481243}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os necrófagos seguem na sombra da Vela Celeste, banqueteando-se com as carcaças dos monstros que atacaram a cidade flutuante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e8f235e-5cd2-40b4-8f3b-2cab7b40e7e4\', \'multiverseId\': 481502}, \'multiverseid\': 481502}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'За Небесным Парусом неизменно следуют падальщики, которые питаются останками чудовищ, нападавших на летающий город.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70928ee5-1628-4ed1-868b-d8a37ca8b61e\', \'multiverseId\': 481761}, \'multiverseid\': 481761}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'拾荒者追随翔空城的阴影移动，拿试图攻击这座漂浮城市的怪兽尸体果腹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'813e400f-80d7-471c-84bb-18acccd91ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 482020}, \'multiverseid\': 482020}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'拾荒者追隨翔空城的陰影移動，拿試圖攻擊這座漂浮城市的怪獸屍體果腹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85ef6672-c945-4f35-b3b7-8876311af8ab\', \'multiverseId\': 482279}, \'multiverseid\': 482279}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anpassungsfähiger Schimmerer\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nDer Anpassungsfähige Schimmerer kommt mit drei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Bist du sicher, dass du sehen möchtest, was da rauskommt? Du wirst es nicht mögen. Es wird dich definitiv nicht mögen."\\n—Kinnan, Bynder-Naturtalent\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479780&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeca100f-1c85-4e8e-ae48-06b8e14fb447\', \'multiverseId\': 479780}, \'multiverseid\': 479780}, {\'name\': \'Deslumbrador cambiante\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEl Deslumbrador cambiante entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Seguro que deseas ver qué nace? Es posible que no te guste. Sin duda, no le gustarás".\\n—Kinnan, el Vinculador Prodigioso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0a35fb3-a7e1-4cf5-a9d1-65dd45293c77\', \'multiverseId\': 480039}, \'multiverseid\': 480039}, {\'name\': \'Scintilleur évolutif\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nLe Scintilleur évolutif arrive sur le champ de bataille avec trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\', \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'« Voulez-vous vraiment voir ce qui va en sortir ? Vous risquez de ne pas aimer. Et cette bête ne vous aimera pas non plus. »\\n—Kinnan, prodige brideur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480298&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bf51529-2bb7-40a6-92d2-85cd274e1ece\', \'multiverseId\': 480298}, \'multiverseid\': 480298}, {\'name\': \'Scintillante Adattivo\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nLo Scintillante Adattivo entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Vuoi davvero vedere cosa emerge? Potrebbe non piacerti. Sicuramente tu non piacerai a lui."\\n—Kinnan, vincolatore prodigio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb8abe5-14f7-4e4e-9f25-230d63f69d45\', \'multiverseId\': 480557}, \'multiverseid\': 480557}, {\'name\': \'順応する煌くもの\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n順応する煌くものは＋１/＋１カウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「本気で何が出てくるか見たいのか？気に入らないかもしれないし、気に入られることは絶対ないぞ。」\\n――眷者の神童、キナン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1059d5b-1de6-4988-a3a8-fe540a541342\', \'multiverseId\': 480816}, \'multiverseid\': 480816}, {\'name\': \'적응하는 반짝벌레\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n적응하는 반짝벌레는 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': \'"정말로 뭐가 나타날지를 보고 싶어? 썩 마음에 들지 않을 수도 있어. 그건 확실하게 널 안 좋아할 거고."\\n—천재 유대자, 키난\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f9a33f-f71e-4b3c-b73e-1957ecd5c3af\', \'multiverseId\': 481075}, \'multiverseid\': 481075}, {\'name\': \'Cintilador Adaptável\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nCintilador Adaptável entra no campo de batalha com três marcadores +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'"Tem certeza de que quer ver o que vem à tona? Você pode não gostar. E a coisa definitivamente não vai gostar de você."\\n— Kinnan, vinculador prodígio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcdc22a5-f725-48ef-8924-c8ae4a563747\', \'multiverseId\': 481334}, \'multiverseid\': 481334}, {\'name\': \'Адаптирующаяся Сиятельница\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nАдаптирующаяся Сиятельница выходит на поле битвы с тремя жетонами +1/+1 на ней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'«А ты точно хочешь посмотреть, что оттуда вылупится? Тебе эта штука может не понравиться. А уж ты ей и подавно».\\n— Киннан, одаренный узомант\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b909ad62-6a9f-42ee-a936-d509e920a09c\', \'multiverseId\': 481593}, \'multiverseid\': 481593}, {\'name\': \'适境烁光虫\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n适境烁光虫进战场时上面有三个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「你真的要看它会变出什么东西吗？你不会喜欢的。它显然不喜欢你。」\\n～持绊逸才季宁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05e479a3-f943-40c0-93c2-55cce3a77a82\', \'multiverseId\': 481852}, \'multiverseid\': 481852}, {\'name\': \'適境爍光蟲\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n適境爍光蟲進戰場時上面有三個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': \'「你真的要看牠會變出什麼東西嗎？你不會喜歡的。牠顯然不喜歡你。」\\n～持絆逸才季寧\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'244ba09b-9519-4766-ba7e-6545938c593b\', \'multiverseId\': 482111}, \'multiverseid\': 482111}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ansturm der Ewigkeitsbestie\', \'text\': \'Zeige als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand offen vor.\\nDer Ansturm der Ewigkeitsbestie fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der vorgezeigten Karte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Feuchtgebiete von Zagoth sind seit Jahrzehnten mit den einstigen Herausforderern von Brokkos übersät.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0659ed90-32ac-43fa-add2-7a622a4f6848\', \'multiverseId\': 479926}, \'multiverseid\': 479926}, {\'name\': \'Carga de la Bestia Infinita\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, muestra una carta de criatura de tu mano.\\nLa Carga de la Bestia Infinita hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo igual a la fuerza de la carta mostrada.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los humedales de Zagoth están fertilizados por siglos de cadáveres de rivales de Brokkos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c7cf51-c777-492d-92b6-ac686dc0ee2f\', \'multiverseId\': 480185}, \'multiverseid\': 480185}, {\'name\': "Charge de la Bête d\'éternité", \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, révélez une carte de créature de votre main.\\nLa Charge de la Bête d\'éternité inflige à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, un nombre de blessures égal à la force de la carte révélée.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les marais de Zagoth sont fertilisés depuis des siècles par les carcasses des anciens adversaires de Brokkos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480444&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1deed53-539c-40dd-b70f-e0444219c165\', \'multiverseId\': 480444}, \'multiverseid\': 480444}, {\'name\': \'Carica della Bestia Eterna\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, rivela una carta creatura dalla tua mano.\\nLa Carica della Bestia Eterna infligge a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio danno pari alla forza della carta rivelata.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli acquitrini di Zagoth sono fertilizzati da secoli di sfidanti di Broykos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6010af-9ffc-4d9a-a276-02bff4ac6e71\', \'multiverseId\': 480703}, \'multiverseid\': 480703}, {\'name\': \'永遠獣の突撃\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、あなたの手札からクリーチャー・カード１枚を公開する。\\nクリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。永遠獣の突撃はそれに、その公開したカードのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'何世紀にもわたりブロコスに挑んできたものが、ゼイゴスの湿地帯の肥沃な土壌を作っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9204da2-7cd1-44f0-a016-26fd64519855\', \'multiverseId\': 480962}, \'multiverseid\': 480962}, {\'name\': \'영원한 야수의 돌진\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 당신의 손에서 생물 카드 한 장을 공개한다.\\n생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 영원한 야수의 돌진은 그 목표에게 공개된 카드의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'브로코스의 옛 도전자들이 자고스 습지에 수 세기 동안 영양분을 공급해 주었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64dedd0e-28df-4688-b05a-ff26ce945841\', \'multiverseId\': 481221}, \'multiverseid\': 481221}, {\'name\': \'Carga da Fera Eterna\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, revele um card de criatura da sua mão.\\nCarga da Fera Eterna causa à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo dano igual ao poder do card revelado.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os pantanais de Zagoth são fertilizados pelos cadáveres dos ex-desafiantes de Brokkos caídos nos últimos séculos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'588d7106-17f5-4cc4-be6e-6c714e6271f2\', \'multiverseId\': 481480}, \'multiverseid\': 481480}, {\'name\': \'Натиск Вечного Зверя\', \'text\': "В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания покажите карту существа из вашей руки.\\nНатиск Вечного Зверя наносит целевому существу или planeswalker\'у повреждения, равные значению силы показанной карты.", \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Низовья Загота на протяжении веков удобряются останками тех, кто бросил вызов Броккосу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b087d7a6-979b-467c-a918-c52616988020\', \'multiverseId\': 481739}, \'multiverseid\': 481739}, {\'name\': \'恒天犀冲锋\', \'text\': \'从你手上展示一张生物牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n恒天犀冲锋对目标生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于所展示之牌的力量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'数世纪来源源不断的挑战者在布洛寇面前现身，然后化为札苟斯湿地的养分。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27ed8279-4ee9-4e64-85d5-26181e48610c\', \'multiverseId\': 481998}, \'multiverseid\': 481998}, {\'name\': \'恆天犀衝鋒\', \'text\': \'從你手上展示一張生物牌，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n恆天犀衝鋒對目標生物或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於所展示之牌的力量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'數世紀來源源不斷的挑戰者在布洛寇面前現身，然後化為札苟斯濕地的養分。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5e2be09-a138-417c-8a4a-7cab4940ae1e\', \'multiverseId\': 482257}, \'multiverseid\': 482257}]', '[{\'name\': \'Antizipieren\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bynder und ihre Gefährten bewegen sich im Gleichklang, intuitiv die nächste Bewegung des anderen vorausahnend.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479819&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddcf7335-ac4f-4226-ae01-2439f316fca2\', \'multiverseId\': 479819}, \'multiverseid\': 479819}, {\'name\': \'Anticipar\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Vinculador y vinculado se mueven al unísono, intuyendo el siguiente movimiento del otro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d26792ce-be93-40d3-8dd1-0c27c177f558\', \'multiverseId\': 480078}, \'multiverseid\': 480078}, {\'name\': \'Anticipation\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Brideur et bridé avancent à l\'unisson et anticipent chacun les mouvements de l\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480337&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c42b3354-2326-44d4-ab9c-23cb5cc8897c\', \'multiverseId\': 480337}, \'multiverseid\': 480337}, {\'name\': \'Anticipare\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Vincolatore e vincolato si muovono all\'unisono, intuendo ciascuno la prossima mossa dell\'altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae55937c-1c1e-405b-b346-2b52d864b178\', \'multiverseId\': 480596}, \'multiverseid\': 480596}, {\'name\': \'予期\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'眷者と相棒は互いの次の動きを感じ取り、一体となって動く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e85b83a2-be3a-4d2b-814e-d681ad631901\', \'multiverseId\': 480855}, \'multiverseid\': 480855}, {\'name\': \'예측\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'유대자는 유대한 동물과 함께 서로의 다음 움직임을 직감하며 한 몸처럼 움직였다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a24246e4-bdf5-42be-84ea-3b736da34a70\', \'multiverseId\': 481114}, \'multiverseid\': 481114}, {\'name\': \'Antecipar\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles na sua mão e os restantes no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Vinculador e vinculado movem-se em uníssono, intuindo o próximo movimento um do outro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e8eedfd-a5f3-4809-8fb4-678157c753bb\', \'multiverseId\': 481373}, \'multiverseid\': 481373}, {\'name\': \'Предвосхищение\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Узомант и его зверь двигаются в унисон, и каждый предугадывает следующее движение своего спутника.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3575cfac-1079-4d60-9d86-31fdf966cef2\', \'multiverseId\': 481632}, \'multiverseid\': 481632}, {\'name\': \'预先考虑\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，其余的牌则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'持绊人与受绊者齐心行动，凭直觉就能知晓对方接下来的动作。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cbf25a5-3c53-4c9d-a7a4-c45190ca9392\', \'multiverseId\': 481891}, \'multiverseid\': 481891}, {\'name\': \'預先考慮\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'持絆人與受絆者齊心行動，憑直覺就能知曉對方接下來的動作。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d55f67b4-a216-410c-81cf-a633bfe08632\', \'multiverseId\': 482150}, \'multiverseid\': 482150}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archipelagor\', \'text\': \'Mutation {5}{U} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Mutationskosten wirkst, lege ihn auf oder unter eine Nicht-Mensch-Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du besitzt. Sie mutieren zur oben liegenden Kreatur, die zusätzlich alle Fähigkeiten der darunter liegenden hat.)\\nImmer wenn diese Kreatur mutiert, tappe bis zu X Kreaturen deiner Wahl, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Mutationen dieser Kreatur ist. Die Kreaturen enttappen nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihrer Beherrscher.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Leviathan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479820&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5606734f-3197-4347-8427-eabf1334d46f\', \'multiverseId\': 479820}, \'multiverseid\': 479820}, {\'name\': \'Archipielagante\', \'text\': \'Mutación {5}{U}. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de mutación, ponlo sobre o bajo la criatura objetivo que no sea Humano de la cual eres propietario. Estas mutan en la criatura de la parte superior más todas las habilidades de debajo.)\\nSiempre que esta criatura mute, gira hasta X criaturas objetivo, donde X es la cantidad de veces que esta criatura ha mutado. Esas criaturas no se enderezan durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Leviatán\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd22d421-5152-4bb7-85df-220ac8df0e1f\', \'multiverseId\': 480079}, \'multiverseid\': 480079}, {\'name\': \'Archipélagore\', \'text\': "Mutation {5}{U} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de mutation, mettez-le au-dessus ou au-dessous d\'une créature non-Humain ciblée que vous possédez. La créature mutante est la créature du dessus, avec toutes les capacités des cartes au-dessous.)\\nÀ chaque fois que cette créature subit une mutation, engagez jusqu\'à X créatures ciblées, X étant le nombre de mutations subies par cette créature. Ces créatures ne se dégagent pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de leur contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : léviathan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480338&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36cc9ce7-aeb4-4fc2-82d9-77f3858cd550\', \'multiverseId\': 480338}, \'multiverseid\': 480338}, {\'name\': \'Arcipelagolia\', \'text\': \'Mutazione {5}{U} (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di mutazione, mettila sopra o sotto una creatura non Umano bersaglio che possiedi. Muta nella creatura sopra, con anche le abilità di quelle sotto.)\\nOgniqualvolta questa creatura muta, TAPpa fino a X creature bersaglio, dove X è il numero di volte che questa creatura è mutata. Quelle creature non STAPpano durante il prossimo STAP del loro controllore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Leviatano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4543ac51-f203-4d62-9438-91d4238a43a6\', \'multiverseId\': 480597}, \'multiverseid\': 480597}, {\'name\': \'肉食島\', \'text\': \'変容{5}{U}（あなたがこの呪文をこれの変容コストで唱えるなら、あなたがオーナーであり人間でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれの上か下に置く。これらは、一番上のクリーチャーに、その下にある能力すべてを加えたものに変容する。）\\nこのクリーチャーが変容するたび、クリーチャー最大Ｘ体を対象とし、それらをタップする。Ｘはこのクリーチャーが変容した回数に等しい。それらのクリーチャーは、それらのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — リバイアサン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7278b6a3-1f3b-4785-b6e0-00b653f37d21\', \'multiverseId\': 480856}, \'multiverseid\': 480856}, {\'name\': \'섬괴수\', \'text\': \'돌연변이화 {5}{U} (당신이 돌연변이화 비용을 지불해 이 주문을 발동한다면, 당신이 소유한 인간이 아닌 생물을 목표로 정한다. 이 카드를 그 생물의 위 또는 아래에 놓는다. 그 생물은 맨 위에 있는 생물이 그 아래에 놓인 카드들의 모든 능력을 가진 생물로 돌연변이화한다.)\\n이 생물이 돌연변이화할 때마다, 생물을 최대 X개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 탭한다. X는 이 생물이 돌연변이화한 수이다. 그 생물들은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 리바이어던\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8df8c9d6-7dfe-4958-b450-3f4c6c249d2b\', \'multiverseId\': 481115}, \'multiverseid\': 481115}, {\'name\': \'Arquipelagórico\', \'text\': \'Mutação {5}{U} (Se você conjurar esta mágica pelo custo de mutação, coloque-a sobre ou sob a criatura alvo que você possui que não seja um Humano. Elas sofrem uma mutação que resulta na criatura de cima com todas as habilidades das criaturas de baixo.)\\nToda vez que esta criatura sofrer mutação, vire até X criaturas alvo, sendo X o número de mutações desta criatura. Aquelas criaturas não são desviradas durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seus controladores.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Leviatã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f93b075-e54f-4130-8cf1-513e20c8abd0\', \'multiverseId\': 481374}, \'multiverseid\': 481374}, {\'name\': \'Кровархипелаг\', \'text\': \'Мутация {5}{U} (Если вы разыграли это заклинание за его стоимость Мутации, положите его сверху или снизу целевого принадлежащего вам существа, не являющегося Человеком. Они мутируют в существо сверху, которому добавляются все способности снизу.)\\nКаждый раз, когда это существо мутирует, поверните не более X целевых существ, где Х — число мутаций этого существа. Те существа не разворачиваются во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего их игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Левиафан\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'701f59cb-76b0-41c0-b9f7-d3232507294a\', \'multiverseId\': 481633}, \'multiverseid\': 481633}, {\'name\': \'千岛海怪\', \'text\': \'合变{5}{U}（如果你支付此咒语的合变费用来施放之，则将它放置在目标由你拥有之非人类生物的顶上或底下。它们合变作顶上的生物，外加具有底下所有异能。）\\n每当此生物合变时，横置至多X个目标生物，X为此生物已合变的次数。这些生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～海怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dc9d4ab-a497-438a-951c-722c72ce13e0\', \'multiverseId\': 481892}, \'multiverseid\': 481892}, {\'name\': \'千島海怪\', \'text\': \'合變{5}{U}（如果你支付此咒語的合變費用來施放之，則將它放置在目標由你擁有之非人類生物的頂上或底下。它們合變作頂上的生物，外加具有底下所有異能。）\\n每當此生物合變時，橫置至多X個目標生物，X為此生物已合變的次數。這些生物於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～海怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d93e10a6-6c8d-4926-9d9b-e107b43efee5\', \'multiverseId\': 482151}, \'multiverseid\': 482151}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufkeimendes Ultimatum\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu drei einfarbigen Karten mit unterschiedlichen Namen und schicke sie ins Exil. Ein Gegner bestimmt eine jener Karten. Mische sie in deine Bibliothek. Du kannst die anderen Karten wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Schicke das Aufkeimende Ultimatum ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b53cf30-73d3-4edc-a37c-fbc98bb7b36d\', \'multiverseId\': 479964}, \'multiverseid\': 479964}, {\'name\': \'Ultimátum emergente\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta tres cartas monocolores con nombres distintos y exílialas. Un oponente elige una de esas cartas. Baraja esa carta en tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar las otras cartas sin pagar sus costes de maná. Exilia el Ultimátum emergente.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6129251b-e34b-4556-bb48-cee04ef6fbb6\', \'multiverseId\': 480223}, \'multiverseid\': 480223}, {\'name\': \'Ultimatum émergent\', \'text\': "Cherchez jusqu\'à trois cartes monochromes avec des noms différents dans votre bibliothèque et exilez-les. Un adversaire choisit une de ces cartes. Mélangez cette carte dans votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer les autres cartes sans payer leur coût de mana. Exilez l\'Ultimatum émergent.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480482&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f05c27b-57ae-4982-a6bc-42b67d071556\', \'multiverseId\': 480482}, \'multiverseid\': 480482}, {\'name\': \'Ultimatum Inatteso\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a tre carte monocolore con nomi diversi ed esiliale. Un avversario sceglie una di quelle carte. Rimescola quella carta nel tuo grimorio. Puoi lanciare le altre carte senza pagare il loro costo di mana. Esilia l\'Ultimatum Inatteso.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92c56e20-ca31-4fb1-a32e-edbb0b16dd68\', \'multiverseId\': 480741}, \'multiverseid\': 480741}, {\'name\': \'出現の根本原理\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから名前の異なる単色のカード最大３枚を探し、それらを追放する。対戦相手１人は、それらのカードのうち１枚を選ぶ。そのカードをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。あなたはその残りのカードを、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。出現の根本原理を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7af1f558-e93b-4de2-8c7a-2c63cf31beb0\', \'multiverseId\': 481000}, \'multiverseid\': 481000}, {\'name\': \'드러나는 최후통첩\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 서로 다른 이름을 가진 단색 카드들을 최대 세 장까지 찾아 그 카드들을 추방한다. 상대가 그 카드들 중 한 장을 선택한다. 그 카드를 당신의 서고에 섞어넣는다. 당신은 나머지 카드들을 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다. 드러나는 최후통첩을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23bb086b-43a6-45ca-8369-6df9db204987\', \'multiverseId\': 481259}, \'multiverseid\': 481259}, {\'name\': \'Ultimato Emergente\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório até três cards monocolores com nomes diferentes e exile-os. Um oponente escolhe um daqueles cards. Embaralhe aquele card em seu grimório. Você pode conjurar os outros cards sem pagar seus custos de mana. Exile Ultimato Emergente.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eb7e2a6-59fa-460f-ba07-e0e73d5efab9\', \'multiverseId\': 481518}, \'multiverseid\': 481518}, {\'name\': \'Новоявленный Ультиматум\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более трех одноцветных карт с различными именами и изгоните их. Оппонент выбирает одну из тех карт. Втасуйте ту карту в вашу библиотеку. Вы можете разыграть остальные карты без уплаты их мана-стоимости. Изгоните Новоявленный Ультиматум.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6431b436-b897-4d82-b7b9-5f300c088d31\', \'multiverseId\': 481777}, \'multiverseid\': 481777}, {\'name\': \'突发通牒\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多三张名称各不相同的单色牌并将这些牌放逐。由任一对手选择其中一张。将该牌洗入你的牌库。你可以施放其余的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。放逐突发通牒。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d52cfb7-3f92-452b-bdf1-895d5b113f7a\', \'multiverseId\': 482036}, \'multiverseid\': 482036}, {\'name\': \'突發通牒\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋至多三張名稱各不相同的單色牌並將這些牌放逐。由任一對手選擇其中一張。將該牌洗入你的牌庫。你可以施放其餘的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。放逐突發通牒。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6016c550-cc31-42ba-a590-c832d53b269f\', \'multiverseId\': 482295}, \'multiverseid\': 482295}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufklärungsmission\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Bynder arbeiten mit Kreaturen, die fliegen, schleichen und graben. Geh davon aus, dass du vor ihnen nichts geheimhalten kannst."\\n—Jirina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479844&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22efff3a-9666-464a-aca1-ea8a333a5554\', \'multiverseId\': 479844}, \'multiverseid\': 479844}, {\'name\': \'Misión de reconocimiento\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar una carta.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Los vinculadores trabajan con criaturas que vuelan, se escabullen y excavan. Da por supuesto que lo saben todo".\\n—Jirina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89be5c2b-88f7-4b64-a689-6a95d461946b\', \'multiverseId\': 480103}, \'multiverseid\': 480103}, {\'name\': \'Mission de reconnaissance\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher une carte.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Les brideurs travaillent avec des créatures qui volent, qui rampent et qui creusent. Autant dire qu\'ils savent tout. »\\n—Jirina Koudro", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bef0039-3fae-4b08-ae1e-fd653da31050\', \'multiverseId\': 480362}, \'multiverseid\': 480362}, {\'name\': \'Missione di Ricognizione\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pescare una carta.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"I vincolatori collaborano con creature che volano, strisciano e scavano. Dai per scontato che sappiano tutto."\\n—Jerina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b38d28c-869b-4c04-98b6-e3886be2ef4b\', \'multiverseId\': 480621}, \'multiverseid\': 480621}, {\'name\': \'偵察任務\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体、プレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「眷者というのは、飛んだり這ったり潜ったりする生き物どもと組んでいる。何でも知っていて当然だろう。」\\n――ジリーナ・クードロ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f987fc2-4812-46da-8510-bba45bc15594\', \'multiverseId\': 480880}, \'multiverseid\': 480880}, {\'name\': \'정찰 임무\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑을 수 있다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"유대자들은 날고, 기고, 숨는 생물들과 함께 다니지. 모든 걸 알고 있다고 생각하도록 해."\\n—지리나 쿠드로\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9890d4db-0f61-4d59-90aa-27bce93baede\', \'multiverseId\': 481139}, \'multiverseid\': 481139}, {\'name\': \'Missão de Reconhecimento\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode comprar um card.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Os vinculadores trabalham com criaturas que voam, rastejam e escavam. Parta do princípio de que eles sabem tudo."\\n— Jirrina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c975c595-f6bf-466a-9d48-c9e139bdf366\', \'multiverseId\': 481398}, \'multiverseid\': 481398}, {\'name\': \'Разведывательная Вылазка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете взять карту.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Узоманты работают с существами, которые летают, крадутся, зарываются в землю. Наверное, они знают все».\\n— Джирина Кудро\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e9aa3e7-3703-40bc-b71e-0f0bb6e418d4\', \'multiverseId\': 481657}, \'multiverseid\': 481657}, {\'name\': \'侦察任务\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以抓一张牌。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「持绊人神通广大，能与上天穿水入地各类生物搭档。就当他们知道一切。」\\n～杰琳娜寇卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ada1c5e-de3a-4b7e-9fe1-ac073c82b94c\', \'multiverseId\': 481916}, \'multiverseid\': 481916}, {\'name\': \'偵察任務\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，你可以抽一張牌。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「持絆人神通廣大，能與上天穿水入地各類生物搭檔。就當他們知道一切。」\\n～傑琳娜寇卓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'925ad33c-e974-4331-829d-7e861eaacdab\', \'multiverseId\': 482175}, \'multiverseid\': 482175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufmerksame Sinnesbynderin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments erhältst du für jede Kreatur mit Wachsamkeit, die du kontrollierst, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'In Anbetracht der eifrigen Armeen, der abscheulichen Wilderer und der titanischen Monster ist es immer ratsam, ein Auge auf den Horizont zu werfen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479997&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6954852e-36f9-4f2c-ae78-1a0fdced73b0\', \'multiverseId\': 479997}, \'multiverseid\': 479997}, {\'name\': \'Vinculaatenciones en alerta\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, ganas 1 vida por cada criatura que controlas con la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'Si pensamos en los fervientes ejércitos, los viles cazadores furtivos y los monstruos titánicos, siempre es buena idea vigilar el horizonte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93820f1e-7135-454e-920a-e5fdcf28234a\', \'multiverseId\': 480256}, \'multiverseid\': 480256}, {\'name\': \'Bridevigilance alerte\', \'text\': \'Vigilance\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature avec la vigilance que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "Au vu de la quantité d\'armées vaillantes, de vils braconniers, et de monstres titanesques, il est toujours bon de garder un œil sur l\'horizon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480515&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a73e45ac-fd87-48df-90ca-d1906ba74ca0\', \'multiverseId\': 480515}, \'multiverseid\': 480515}, {\'name\': \'Vincolaintuito Vigile\', \'text\': "Cautela\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura con cautela che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': "Tra eserciti zelanti, ignobili cacciatori di frodo e mostri titanici, è sempre saggio tenere d\'occhio l\'orizzonte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e2b3533-60a1-4ec8-b6b9-e77cfe28cf66\', \'multiverseId\': 480774}, \'multiverseid\': 480774}, {\'name\': \'慎重な認知眷者\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたはあなたがコントロールしていて警戒を持つクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'盲信者の軍勢や、卑劣な密猟者、巨大な怪物に備えて、地平線まで目を光らせておくに越したことはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'035b6882-a75a-472a-9622-92c6eb83ee44\', \'multiverseId\': 481033}, \'multiverseid\': 481033}, {\'name\': \'경계하는 인식유대자\', \'text\': \'경계\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 경계를 가진 각 생물마다 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 정찰병\', \'flavor\': \'열성적인 군대, 사악한 밀렵꾼들, 거대한 괴수들을 고려하면, 수평선에서 눈을 떼지 않는 것이 언제나 현명한 일이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e9b5e5-942f-41b3-93f6-ba2635ea32a4\', \'multiverseId\': 481292}, \'multiverseid\': 481292}, {\'name\': \'Vinculador dos Sensos Alerta\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nNo início de sua etapa final, você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada criatura que você controla com vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'Considerando os exércitos zelosos, os vis caçadores e os monstros titânicos, é sempre sábio ficar de olho no horizonte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be893e39-1819-411c-be73-dc5bfe2a099b\', \'multiverseId\': 481551}, \'multiverseid\': 481551}, {\'name\': \'Настороженная Узомантка Внимания\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага вы получаете 1 жизнь за каждое существо с Бдительностью под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Учитывая фанатичные армии, жестоких браконьеров и колоссальных чудовищ, всегда имеет смысл следить за тем, что происходит на горизонте.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c75e681-bc50-4930-af40-b70076f88be9\', \'multiverseId\': 481810}, \'multiverseid\': 481810}, {\'name\': \'警觉智绊人\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，你每操控一个具警戒异能的生物，便获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'考虑到有狂热军队、卑劣猎者和庞巨怪兽，留点心思提防天边总是好的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64565014-c7c2-49bb-a9ec-060365b71bca\', \'multiverseId\': 482069}, \'multiverseid\': 482069}, {\'name\': \'警覺智絆人\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，你每操控一個具警戒異能的生物，便獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'考慮到有狂熱軍隊、卑劣獵者和龐巨怪獸，留點心思提防天邊總是好的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a251c6f-4997-4c6d-83da-d78085e2d863\', \'multiverseId\': 482328}, \'multiverseid\': 482328}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgewachsen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Lege eine Trampelschaden-Marke auf sie.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Eines Tages wachte ich auf und wusste, dass ich ihr nichts mehr beibringen konnte. Jetzt reite ich auf ihren Schultern und folge ihr, wohin sie mich führt."\\n—Gustin, Wildbynder\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a9d3888-4c3f-4d98-81ee-ec63e52a7138\', \'multiverseId\': 479933}, \'multiverseid\': 479933}, {\'name\': \'En la fase adulta\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno. Pon un contador de arrollar sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un día desperté y supe que no me quedaba nada que enseñarle. Así que ahora cabalgo sobre sus hombros y la sigo donde me lleva".\\n—Gustin, vinculafieras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099b8620-cb30-4f03-af6a-3b6271bb5431\', \'multiverseId\': 480192}, \'multiverseid\': 480192}, {\'name\': \'Taille maximale\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Mettez un marqueur « piétinement » sur elle.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Un jour, en me levant, j\'ai compris que je n\'avais plus rien à lui apprendre. Alors maintenant je monte sur son épaule et je la laisse me guider. »\\n—Gustin, bridecroissance", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f22590d-a18e-4d19-8919-0ca4634a9465\', \'multiverseId\': 480451}, \'multiverseid\': 480451}, {\'name\': \'Completamente Cresciuto\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno. Metti un segnalino travolgere su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un giorno mi svegliai e mi resi conto che non avevo più nulla da insegnargli, quindi ora salgo sulle sue spalle e lo seguo ovunque mi guidi."\\n—Gustin, vincolaferocia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13aa329f-c243-4843-b76f-317284441761\', \'multiverseId\': 480710}, \'multiverseid\': 480710}, {\'name\': \'充分な成長\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。それの上にトランプル・カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ある日目が覚めると、もう教えることは何もないと気付いた。だから今は彼女の肩に乗って、導くままに従っている。」\\n――野生眷者、ガスティン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f408373a-7499-419c-97f2-85d9def44c1d\', \'multiverseId\': 480969}, \'multiverseid\': 480969}, {\'name\': \'성장 완료\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+3을 받는다. 그 생물에 돌진 카운터를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"어느 날 잠에서 깼을 때, 나는 더이상 그녀에게 가르칠 것이 없다는 것을 깨달았다. 그래서 이제 나는 그녀의 어깨에 올라타 그녀가 이끄는 곳으로 따라간다."\\n—야생유대자, 거스틴\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'229f3ff5-2c9f-40a7-b0aa-8dc1f4b60bcd\', \'multiverseId\': 481228}, \'multiverseid\': 481228}, {\'name\': \'Totalmente Crescido\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+3 até o final do turno. Coloque um marcador de atropelar nela.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Um dia eu acordei e soube que não tinha mais nada para ensinar a ela. Agora, eu monto nos ombros dela e vou aonde ela me leva."\\n— Gustin, vinculador das selvas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62ae5dad-ceb7-4afc-bb45-d52aaf01a662\', \'multiverseId\': 481487}, \'multiverseid\': 481487}, {\'name\': \'Полный Рост\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+3 до конца хода. Положите на него один жетон Пробивного удара.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Однажды я проснулся и понял, что мне больше нечему ее учить. Так что теперь я катаюсь у нее на плече, и она сама решает, куда нам направиться».\\n— Гастин, узомант свирепости\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02939b96-8622-47d8-9864-c16a483b0298\', \'multiverseId\': 481746}, \'multiverseid\': 481746}, {\'name\': \'茁壮成长\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。在其上放置一个践踏指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「有一天醒来之后，我意识到已经没有能够教她的东西了。于是我就骑上她的肩头，随她自由奔袭。」\\n～蛮野持绊人古斯丁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4910eca-1b91-43d6-9b62-a65fa47ce879\', \'multiverseId\': 482005}, \'multiverseid\': 482005}, {\'name\': \'茁壯成長\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+3/+3直到回合結束。在其上放置一個踐踏指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「有一天醒來之後，我意識到已經沒有能夠教她的東西了。於是我就騎上她的肩頭，隨她自由奔襲。」\\n～蠻野持絆人古斯丁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3923550-dc80-427d-8adc-0a218cff0c1c\', \'multiverseId\': 482264}, \'multiverseid\': 482264}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgrabungsmaulwurf\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn der Ausgrabungsmaulwurf ins Spiel kommt, lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Maulwurf\', \'flavor\': \'Er verwandelt Berge in Maulwurfshügel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20016696-a78b-4afc-bbf5-f1ea97b3d0db\', \'multiverseId\': 479929}, \'multiverseid\': 479929}, {\'name\': \'Topo de la excavación\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nCuando el Topo de la excavación entre al campo de batalla, pon las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Topo\', \'flavor\': \'Convierte montañas en toperas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db7ce9dc-4715-43a1-b988-ef24cccd4da6\', \'multiverseId\': 480188}, \'multiverseid\': 480188}, {\'name\': "Taupe d\'excavation", \'text\': "Piétinement\\nQuand la Taupe d\'excavation arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : taupe\', \'flavor\': \'Ses taupinières sont grandes comme des montagnes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27fecd53-2583-4a1f-bece-3e0b6ac8c3c7\', \'multiverseId\': 480447}, \'multiverseid\': 480447}, {\'name\': \'Talpa da Escavazione\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nQuando la Talpa da Escavazione entra nel campo di battaglia, metti nel tuo cimitero le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Talpa\', \'flavor\': \'Riduce le montagne a granelli di sabbia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b5caec-c6a7-4bc6-8faa-329464b7cd0f\', \'multiverseId\': 480706}, \'multiverseid\': 480706}, {\'name\': \'掘削モグラ\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n掘削モグラが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚あなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — モグラ\', \'flavor\': \'それは山からモグラ塚を作る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'290ecf6f-e10e-406c-bd82-20574babedef\', \'multiverseId\': 480965}, \'multiverseid\': 480965}, {\'name\': \'굴착 두더지\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n굴착 두더지가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 두더지\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 산으로 두둑을 만든다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'753bcf6d-9807-494a-84f3-a33b545cffff\', \'multiverseId\': 481224}, \'multiverseid\': 481224}, {\'name\': \'Toupeira de Escavação\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nQuando Toupeira de Escavação entrar no campo de batalha, coloque os três cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Toupeira\', \'flavor\': \'Ela faz das montanhas suas tocas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63150ab2-690f-4bb3-96ea-3deea083c20b\', \'multiverseId\': 481483}, \'multiverseid\': 481483}, {\'name\': \'Крот-Раскапыватель\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКогда Крот-Раскапыватель выходит на поле битвы, положите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Крот\', \'flavor\': \'Он из гор делает кротовьи холмики.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cb6e41f-5976-4686-891c-ea27b69637d7\', \'multiverseId\': 481742}, \'multiverseid\': 481742}, {\'name\': \'掘地鼹鼠\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n当掘地鼹鼠进战场时，将你牌库顶的三张牌置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鼹鼠\', \'flavor\': \'它在高山之上打出鼹丘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af8d2e02-fae8-48db-9cde-e78cfb1938ff\', \'multiverseId\': 482001}, \'multiverseid\': 482001}, {\'name\': \'掘地鼴鼠\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n當掘地鼴鼠進戰場時，將你牌庫頂的三張牌置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鼴鼠\', \'flavor\': \'牠在高山之上打出鼴丘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3ce9c02-910b-4e08-9aa1-3a5ede82f406\', \'multiverseId\': 482260}, \'multiverseid\': 482260}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barrierensturm\', \'text\': \'Schicke bis zu drei Verzauberungen deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie bauen Mauern und denken, dass sie dann geschützt sind, aber die größten Monster haben noch jede Mauer überwunden."\\n—Kinnan, Bynder-Naturtalent\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd5cd8e3-dc5a-43bf-b115-592f034e33c0\', \'multiverseId\': 479924}, \'multiverseid\': 479924}, {\'name\': \'Brecha en la barrera\', \'text\': \'Exilia hasta tres encantamientos objetivo.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanzan hechizos defensivos pensando que les protegerán, pero los monstruos más grandes encuentran la forma de pasar".\\n—Kinnan, el Vinculador Prodigioso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92c31d1b-46e4-407a-8a71-177b7b6ead3a\', \'multiverseId\': 480183}, \'multiverseid\': 480183}, {\'name\': \'Brèche de barrière\', \'text\': "Exilez jusqu\'à trois enchantements ciblés.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ils lancent des sorts de protection en pensant qu\'ils seront efficaces, mais les plus grands monstres trouvent toujours le moyen de passer. »\\n—Kinnan, prodige brideur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480442&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2742aa7d-cc94-42a3-a1e5-540f666922ae\', \'multiverseId\': 480442}, \'multiverseid\': 480442}, {\'name\': \'Breccia della Barriera\', \'text\': \'Esilia fino a tre incantesimi bersaglio.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanciano sigilli, pensando che li proteggeranno, ma i mostri più grandi trovano il modo di entrare."\\n—Kinnan, vincolatore prodigio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'796035e8-e333-45aa-b95e-5acaa9a6f8c3\', \'multiverseId\': 480701}, \'multiverseid\': 480701}, {\'name\': \'障壁突破\', \'text\': \'エンチャント最大３つを対象とし、それらを追放する。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「奴らは身を守れると思って結界を張るが、巨大な怪物は突破口を見出すのさ。」\\n――眷者の神童、キナン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d193e85-36c0-4d8a-81d2-8aa1cf9b61c4\', \'multiverseId\': 480960}, \'multiverseid\': 480960}, {\'name\': \'장벽 돌파\', \'text\': \'부여마법을 최대 세 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법들을 추방한다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그들은 보호 주문이 자신들을 보호해 줄 거라고 생각하며 주문을 발동했지만, 가장 큰 괴수들은 통과하는 방법을 찾아냈지."\\n—천재 유대자, 키난\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8945f745-2b37-4fd5-bce6-bf31ecb5052d\', \'multiverseId\': 481219}, \'multiverseid\': 481219}, {\'name\': \'Ruptura na Barreira\', \'text\': \'Exile até três encantamentos alvo.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles conjuram proteções achando que isso os manterá a salvo, mas os maiores monstros sempre acham uma forma de passar por elas."\\n— Kinnan, vinculador prodígio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3035a8df-41ed-4ef0-80c6-89b40a761ae6\', \'multiverseId\': 481478}, \'multiverseid\': 481478}, {\'name\': \'Пролом Преграды\', \'text\': \'Изгоните не более трех целевых чар.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Они создают обереги, думая, что это их защитит, но самые большие чудовища все равно находят путь».\\n— Киннан, одаренный узомант\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86bb740b-7105-42db-a5d0-386a11fdb922\', \'multiverseId\': 481737}, \'multiverseid\': 481737}, {\'name\': \'冲破屏障\', \'text\': \'放逐至多三个目标结界。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「他们施放守护力图自保，然而最大的怪兽还是能一头撞破。」\\n～持绊逸才季宁\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'097b50c3-8838-46b7-85da-bcdf0ab98a24\', \'multiverseId\': 481996}, \'multiverseid\': 481996}, {\'name\': \'衝破屏障\', \'text\': \'放逐至多三個目標結界。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「他們施放守護力圖自保，然而最大的怪獸還是能一頭撞破。」\\n～持絆逸才季寧\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fa18288-92cc-4218-ad5d-f0fa9d6b0968\', \'multiverseId\': 482255}, \'multiverseid\': 482255}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bastion der Erinnerung\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Bastion der Erinnerung ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Genommene Leben sind Leben, die nicht leicht zu vergessen sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479852&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62ce85db-16db-480d-8982-b998a1c41169\', \'multiverseId\': 479852}, \'multiverseid\': 479852}, {\'name\': \'Bastión de los recuerdos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Bastión de los recuerdos entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas muera, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Las vidas arrebatadas no son fáciles de olvidar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11edf779-d265-4541-92e1-1b68b797f8cc\', \'multiverseId\': 480111}, \'multiverseid\': 480111}, {\'name\': \'Bastion du souvenir\', \'text\': "Quand le Bastion du souvenir arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les vies ôtées ne sont pas vite oubliées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480370&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e0dee4b-eb59-4450-a222-58fb7404daae\', \'multiverseId\': 480370}, \'multiverseid\': 480370}, {\'name\': \'Baluardo del Ricordo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Baluardo del Ricordo entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli muore, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Le vite strappate non si dimenticano facilmente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4b99214-62b3-491d-a723-9c927ad96177\', \'multiverseId\': 480629}, \'multiverseid\': 480629}, {\'name\': \'想起の拠点\', \'text\': \'想起の拠点が戦場に出たとき、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'奪われた命を軽々しく忘れるわけにはいかない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'147778ea-7e8c-4bcc-8b8f-d90b1c189e1a\', \'multiverseId\': 480888}, \'multiverseid\': 480888}, {\'name\': \'추모의 요새\', \'text\': \'추모의 요새가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 백색 인간 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n당신이 조종하는 생물이 죽을 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'빼앗긴 목숨은 쉽게 잊혀지지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c669a17-872c-430a-9b28-2a1c7767b220\', \'multiverseId\': 481147}, \'multiverseid\': 481147}, {\'name\': \'Bastião da Recordação\', \'text\': \'Quando Bastião da Recordação entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano Soldado.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla morre, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Vidas tomadas são difíceis de se esquecer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14dd160a-64c9-4c46-9e42-7697b8c8071b\', \'multiverseId\': 481406}, \'multiverseid\': 481406}, {\'name\': \'Бастион Воспоминаний\', \'text\': \'Когда Бастион Воспоминаний выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Человек Солдат.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем умирает, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Жизни, которые забрали, нелегко забыть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15fcb1e8-1ea1-47aa-a35d-a3c4c9a8d4ae\', \'multiverseId\': 481665}, \'multiverseid\': 481665}, {\'name\': \'记忆壁垒\', \'text\': \'当记忆壁垒进战场时，派出一个1/1白色人类／士兵衍生生物。\\n每当一个由你操控的生物死去时，每位对手各失去1点生命，且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'殒落的生命绝不会被轻易遗忘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cc76edc-7f98-4386-b835-f1c916bb3179\', \'multiverseId\': 481924}, \'multiverseid\': 481924}, {\'name\': \'記憶壁壘\', \'text\': \'當記憶壁壘進戰場時，派出一個1/1白色人類／士兵衍生生物。\\n每當一個由你操控的生物死去時，每位對手各失去1點生命，且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'殞落的生命絕不會被輕易遺忘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96ac2e34-6c0d-4b3e-a4b5-82feb376ef4c\', \'multiverseId\': 482183}, \'multiverseid\': 482183}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beizspucker-Gremlin\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Der Beizspucker-Gremlin fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nImmer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, enttappe den Beizspucker-Gremlin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'„Ah, ein Kritiker."\\n—Orthion, Lavagrund-Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8df3ce74-e1ef-4017-b727-f58201d26b71\', \'multiverseId\': 479887}, \'multiverseid\': 479887}, {\'name\': \'Gremlin escupellamas\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: El Gremlin escupellamas hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, endereza el Gremlin escupellamas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'"Mira, si tenemos aquí un crítico".\\n—Orthion, capitán de Bordelava\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b36722-72d6-4bc9-aaf8-db820b8ff2d4\', \'multiverseId\': 480146}, \'multiverseid\': 480146}, {\'name\': \'Gremlin phlyctocracheur\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Le Gremlin phlyctocracheur inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, dégagez le Gremlin phlyctocracheur.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gremlin\', \'flavor\': "« Ah, en voilà un qui n\'est pas satisfait. »\\n—Orthion, capitaine de Bourg-sur-Lave", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480405&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5738c798-419c-4162-8b9d-db47dd39591d\', \'multiverseId\': 480405}, \'multiverseid\': 480405}, {\'name\': \'Gremlin Sputabrace\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Il Gremlin Sputabrace infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, STAPpa il Gremlin Sputabrace.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, abbiamo un critico."\\n—Orthion, capitano di Lavariva\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b205da-92b2-42b9-8b7e-b081b000f0e7\', \'multiverseId\': 480664}, \'multiverseid\': 480664}, {\'name\': \'火傷吐きグレムリン\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：火傷吐きグレムリンは各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\nあなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、火傷吐きグレムリンをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — グレムリン\', \'flavor\': \'「どうやら批評家が現れたようだ。」\\n――ラバブリンクの隊長、オーシオン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c07b3ee7-4227-4de6-b557-413d6db2d46d\', \'multiverseId\': 480923}, \'multiverseid\': 480923}, {\'name\': \'불꽃을 토하는 그렘린\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: 불꽃을 토하는 그렘린은 각 상대에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n당신이 생물이 아닌 주문을 발동할 때마다, 불꽃을 토하는 그렘린을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 그렘린\', \'flavor\': \'"아, 비평가가 납셨군."\\n—용암가장자리 대장, 오르티온\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90718be6-4b16-45a4-8a8a-d01bc0101ee6\', \'multiverseId\': 481182}, \'multiverseid\': 481182}, {\'name\': \'Gremlin do Cuspe Corrosivo\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Gremlin do Cuspe Corrosivo causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica que não seja de criatura, desvire Gremlin do Cuspe Corrosivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gremlin\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, um crítico."\\n— Orthion, capitão de Beiralava\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6d7d9dc-84d8-4372-af0d-53065388d719\', \'multiverseId\': 481441}, \'multiverseid\': 481441}, {\'name\': \'Гремлин Едкой Слюны\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Гремлин Едкой Слюны наносит 1 повреждение каждому оппоненту.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете не являющееся существом заклинание, разверните Гремлина Едкой Слюны.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гремлин\', \'flavor\': \'«О-о, у нас появился критик».\\n— Ортион, капитан Лавобрега\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8ac09a-01f2-4dbe-864d-b7dc9466052e\', \'multiverseId\': 481700}, \'multiverseid\': 481700}, {\'name\': \'蜇息怪灵\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：蜇息怪灵向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\\n每当你施放非生物咒语时，重置蜇息怪灵。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～怪灵\', \'flavor\': \'「啊，有个敢说话的。」\\n～熔缘城队长欧席因\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a66f147c-7654-4dba-9bfa-7d893dfd861a\', \'multiverseId\': 481959}, \'multiverseid\': 481959}, {\'name\': \'蜇息怪靈\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：蜇息怪靈向每位對手各造成1點傷害。\\n每當你施放非生物咒語時，重置蜇息怪靈。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～怪靈\', \'flavor\': \'「啊，有個敢說話的。」\\n～熔緣城隊長歐席因\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3edd9ce-3352-4620-9471-1aaced7ad5b8\', \'multiverseId\': 482218}, \'multiverseid\': 482218}]', '[{\'name\': \'Betäubungspfeil\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Betäubungspfeil ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{T}, opfere den Betäubungspfeil: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Schlafe nun, du große Bestie."\\n—Kelsien der Verseuchte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480019&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b236dad8-2706-40cc-9835-6007f4942ed4\', \'multiverseId\': 480019}, \'multiverseid\': 480019}, {\'name\': \'Dardo adormecedor\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Dardo adormecedor entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Dardo adormecedor: La criatura objetivo no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Duerme, bestia enorme".\\n—Kelsien, la Plaga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ab27d6c-da0f-4a40-94f6-9630bd67287a\', \'multiverseId\': 480278}, \'multiverseid\': 480278}, {\'name\': \'Fléchette soporifique\', \'text\': \'Quand la Fléchette soporifique arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Fléchette soporifique : La créature ciblée ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Maintenant, au lit grosse brute. »\\n—Kelsien, la Peste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480537&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad653e6-cfe6-4128-85cc-9b6eb77385ab\', \'multiverseId\': 480537}, \'multiverseid\': 480537}, {\'name\': \'Dardo Tranquillante\', \'text\': \'Quando il Dardo Tranquillante entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\n{T}, Sacrifica il Dardo Tranquillante: Una creatura bersaglio non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Ora dormi, bestione."\\n—Kelsien, la Piaga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cce0ae4-d5bd-44d1-9d63-8daf31d3528d\', \'multiverseId\': 480796}, \'multiverseid\': 480796}, {\'name\': \'眠らせる矢\', \'text\': \'眠らせる矢が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\n{T}, 眠らせる矢を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。そのクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「眠りな、でかいの。」\\n――疫病をもたらす者、ケルシン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4a2e1ec-0cb2-41d0-9803-20e19bdc1bd2\', \'multiverseId\': 481055}, \'multiverseid\': 481055}, {\'name\': \'마취 다트\', \'text\': \'마취 다트가 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n{T}, 마취 다트를 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"잠들어라, 덩치큰 녀석아."\\n—역병, 켈시엔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e711fb17-5b7c-4b5f-b5cc-008ec13dd220\', \'multiverseId\': 481314}, \'multiverseid\': 481314}, {\'name\': \'Dardo Sonífero\', \'text\': \'Quando Dardo Sonífero entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\n{T}, sacrifique Dardo Sonífero: A criatura alvo não desvira durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Hora da soneca, grandalhão."\\n— Kelsien, a Peste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63679459-3666-495b-94ce-0a5aa26c8c42\', \'multiverseId\': 481573}, \'multiverseid\': 481573}, {\'name\': \'Сонный Дротик\', \'text\': \'Когда Сонный Дротик выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте Сонный Дротик: целевое существо не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Поспи, здоровяк».\\n— Келсиен, Моровая Погибель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26499841-ee7e-47f9-91a2-7cbaf5681cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 481832}, \'multiverseid\': 481832}, {\'name\': \'催眠毒镖\', \'text\': \'当催眠毒镖进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n{T}，牺牲催眠毒镖：目标生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「快睡吧，你这大傻兽。」\\n～疫病凯鑫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42975db4-9e0a-4fc4-8977-e23e26c0c170\', \'multiverseId\': 482091}, \'multiverseid\': 482091}, {\'name\': \'催眠毒鏢\', \'text\': \'當催眠毒鏢進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n{T}，犧牲催眠毒鏢：目標生物於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「快睡吧，你這大傻獸。」\\n～疫病凱鑫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4305b7c6-67c8-4e7d-a5e6-ad665c53a281\', \'multiverseId\': 482350}, \'multiverseid\': 482350}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitz des Donnerraptors\', \'text\': \'Der Blitz des Donnerraptors fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof sind. Falls die Kreatur bzw. der Planeswalker in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie bzw. ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Klang von Vadroks gigantischen Flügeln ist bedrohlich. Aber der wahre Schrecken beginnt, wenn sie verstummen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'791980bc-5e4d-41f2-b3fd-686b9be5eb06\', \'multiverseId\': 479888}, \'multiverseid\': 479888}, {\'name\': \'Picado de la Rapaz del Trueno\', \'text\': \'El Picado de la Rapaz del Trueno hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo igual a la cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio. Si esa criatura o planeswalker fuera a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El sonido de las gigantescas alas de Vadrok es un mal augurio. Pero el auténtico terror llega cuando se hace el silencio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8269b339-7c8d-46d7-8fbb-1864e4fcb4d0\', \'multiverseId\': 480147}, \'multiverseid\': 480147}, {\'name\': \'Attaque éclair du Raptor de tonnerre\', \'text\': "L\'Attaque éclair du Raptor de tonnerre inflige à la cible, créature ou au planeswalker, un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière. Si cette créature ou ce planeswalker devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le bruit des immenses ailes de Vadrok est particulièrement menaçant. Mais le plus terrifiant, c\'est quand on ne l\'entend plus.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480406&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b526989-0753-4828-8932-99e674b8ca4a\', \'multiverseId\': 480406}, \'multiverseid\': 480406}, {\'name\': \'Incursione del Tuonoraptor\', \'text\': "L\'Incursione del Tuonoraptor infligge a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio danno pari al numero di carte istantaneo e stregoneria nel tuo cimitero. Se quella creatura o quel planeswalker stanno per morire in questo turno, invece esiliali.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il rumore delle gigantesche ali di Vadrok è inquietante, ma il vero terrore inizia quando cessa ogni suono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d897afe-aa65-4e8f-8fde-e594c76065fc\', \'multiverseId\': 480665}, \'multiverseid\': 480665}, {\'name\': \'雷猛竜の襲撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。雷猛竜の襲撃はそれに、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーが死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ヴァドロックの巨大な翼の音は気味が悪い。しかし本当に恐ろしいのは、それが静まったときだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72ae4f69-677d-4ee0-a727-028a510b9420\', \'multiverseId\': 480924}, \'multiverseid\': 480924}, {\'name\': \'천둥 랩터의 습격\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 천둥 랩터의 습격은 그 목표에게 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법 및 집중마법 카드의 수만큼 피해를 입힌다. 그 생물 또는 플레인즈워커가 이 턴에 죽는다면, 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'바드로크의 거대한 날개 소리는 불길하다. 하지만 진정한 공포는 그 소리가 없어졌을 때이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'666d6fd8-5fff-4d89-ac3e-afb41fd79d49\', \'multiverseId\': 481183}, \'multiverseid\': 481183}, {\'name\': \'Blitz do Raptor Tonante\', \'text\': \'Blitz do Raptor Tonante causa à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de cards de mágica instantânea e feitiço no seu cemitério. Se aquela criatura ou aquele planeswalker morreria neste turno, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O som das gigantescas asas de Vadrok é assustador. Mas o verdadeiro terror vem com o silêncio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee8ae457-e065-4746-a166-a35269639a8c\', \'multiverseId\': 481442}, \'multiverseid\': 481442}, {\'name\': \'Рывок Громового Хищника\', \'text\': "Рывок Громового Хищника наносит целевому существу или planeswalker\'у повреждения, равные количеству карт мгновенных заклинаний и волшебства на вашем кладбище. Если то существо или planeswalker должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Звук исполинских крыльев Вадрока пугает. Но настоящий ужас начинается, когда они смолкают.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d6a1ccf-59df-42a2-a65e-148b113da490\', \'multiverseId\': 481701}, \'multiverseid\': 481701}, {\'name\': \'雷鸣龙闪击\', \'text\': \'雷鸣龙闪击对目标生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于你坟墓场中瞬间和法术牌的数量加总。如果本回合中该生物或鹏洛客将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'瓦卓克扇动巨翼的声音固然是不详预兆，但翼声沉寂之后，恐怖时刻才真正来临。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fecb978-eb0b-4e28-abf1-e6a95719b33a\', \'multiverseId\': 481960}, \'multiverseid\': 481960}, {\'name\': \'雷鳴龍閃擊\', \'text\': \'雷鳴龍閃擊對目標生物或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於你墳墓場中瞬間和巫術牌的數量加總。如果本回合中該生物或鵬洛客將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'瓦卓克扇動巨翼的聲音固然是不祥預兆，但翼聲沉寂之後，恐怖時刻才真正來臨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71aefffd-19df-4c03-83cb-8dec587a8f25\', \'multiverseId\': 482219}, \'multiverseid\': 482219}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzegel\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn der Blitzegel ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Entferne alle Marken von der Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Egel\', \'flavor\': \'„Narren tragen Rüstung gegen ihn, als wenn das Schlimmste, was er sich holen könnte, dein Blut wäre."\\n—Gavi die Nesthüterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479853&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11006ac2-1137-4bcb-ae53-a61cb6beafa2\', \'multiverseId\': 479853}, \'multiverseid\': 479853}, {\'name\': \'Sanguijuela relámpago\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Sanguijuela relámpago entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno. Remueve todos los contadores de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sanguijuela\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay estúpidos que llevan una armadura para protegerse de ella, como si lo peor que pudiera quitarte fuera la sangre".\\n—Gavi, guardiana del nido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3887a691-c93e-42fc-a294-173d88e47f02\', \'multiverseId\': 480112}, \'multiverseid\': 480112}, {\'name\': "Sangsue à l\'attaque éclair", \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Sangsue à l\'attaque éclair arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Retirez tous les marqueurs de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : sangsue\', \'flavor\': "« Les idiots l\'affrontent en armure comme si le pire qu\'elle pouvait faire était de vous vider de votre sang. »\\n—Gavi, garde du nid", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480371&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbcf8aad-af3b-4614-a016-cf4a37629c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 480371}, \'multiverseid\': 480371}, {\'name\': "Sanguisuga d\'Assalto", \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuando la Sanguisuga d\'Assalto entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno. Rimuovi tutti i segnalini da quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sanguisuga\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli stolti indossano un\\\'armatura per proteggersi, come se la cosa peggiore che possa fare sia succhiarti il sangue."\\n—Gavi, guardiana del nido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'947aeac5-b87c-4c86-a524-6ee382f98f98\', \'multiverseId\': 480630}, \'multiverseid\': 480630}, {\'name\': \'急襲ヒル\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n急襲ヒルが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。そのクリーチャーの上からカウンターをすべて取り除く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヒル\', \'flavor\': \'「愚か者は身を守ろうと鎧を着る。あれは血を吸うだけだとでも思っているのかしら。」\\n――巣守り、ガヴィ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'243c6924-a37c-4ebe-b97d-98fecdb0bafc\', \'multiverseId\': 480889}, \'multiverseid\': 480889}, {\'name\': \'습격하는 거머리\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n습격하는 거머리가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -2/-2를 받는다. 그 생물에 놓인 카운터들을 모두 제거한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거머리\', \'flavor\': \'"바보들은 그 놈이 벌이는 최악의 일이 피를 빠는 거라고 생각해서 갑옷을 입지."\\n—둥지 관리인, 가비\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2faa24f-33bc-4b00-97ee-49024619861b\', \'multiverseId\': 481148}, \'multiverseid\': 481148}, {\'name\': \'Sanguessuga de Assalto\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Sanguessuga de Assalto entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo que um oponente controla recebe -2/-2 até o final do turno. Remova todos os marcadores daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sanguessuga\', \'flavor\': \'"Os tolos usam armaduras contra ela, como se o pior que ela pudesse sugar fosse seu sangue."\\n— Gavi, guardiã do ninho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17948de7-644d-4d8c-bb51-06fc871d8c06\', \'multiverseId\': 481407}, \'multiverseid\': 481407}, {\'name\': \'Проворная Пиявка\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Проворная Пиявка выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо под контролем оппонента получает -2/-2 до конца хода. Удалите все жетоны с того существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пиявка\', \'flavor\': \'«Глупцы носят доспехи, чтобы защититься от нее, словно худшее, что она может взять у тебя, это твоя кровь».\\n— Гави, охранница гнезда\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0843f0e-8016-4e39-bcfd-77026bba0349\', \'multiverseId\': 481666}, \'multiverseid\': 481666}, {\'name\': \'闪击蛭\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当闪击蛭进战场时，目标由对手操控的生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。移去该生物上的所有指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛭\', \'flavor\': \'「愚蠢的人们觉得大不了就是被它吸点血，穿上盔甲就自认安全。」\\n～巢穴护卫盖薇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb74645-6be3-42bf-8ff3-da40bfbb6efd\', \'multiverseId\': 481925}, \'multiverseid\': 481925}, {\'name\': \'閃擊蛭\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當閃擊蛭進戰場時，目標由對手操控的生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。移去該生物上的所有指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛭\', \'flavor\': \'「愚蠢的人們覺得大不了就是被牠吸點血，穿上盔甲就自認安全。」\\n～巢穴護衛蓋薇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9c8ce96-8866-4df2-b409-60bc7650903a\', \'multiverseId\': 482184}, \'multiverseid\': 482184}]', "[{'name': 'Blitzsturm-Capridor', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nFalls dem Blitzsturm-Capridor Nicht-Kampfschaden zugefügt würde, verhindere den Schaden. Lege für jeden 1 Schadenspunkt, der auf diese Weise verhindert wird, eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blitzsturm-Capridor.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vogel, Ziege', 'flavor': 'Nach verheerenden Verlusten wurden die Lavagrund-Blitzmagier zurückgerufen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479813&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cd572ab-d05f-4302-9e08-cd19ae0f024b', 'multiverseId': 479813}, 'multiverseid': 479813}, {'name': 'Cabradora tormentosa', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nSi se fuera a hacer daño que no sea de combate a la Cabradora tormentosa, prevén ese daño. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Cabradora tormentosa por cada punto de daño prevenido de esta manera.', 'type': 'Criatura — Cabra ave', 'flavor': 'Tras un desastroso día de batalla, los magos de rayos de Bordelava recibieron la orden de retirarse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480072&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '573d26b6-915c-4e36-9ae9-58a3d32c33a2', 'multiverseId': 480072}, 'multiverseid': 480072}, {'name': 'Capridor des tempêtes sauvages', 'text': 'Vol\\nSi des blessures non-combat devaient être infligées au Capridor des tempêtes sauvages, prévenez ces blessures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Capridor des tempêtes sauvages pour chaque 1 blessure prévenue de cette manière.', 'type': 'Créature : oiseau et chèvre', 'flavor': 'Après une journée de combat désastreuse, les mages de foudre de Bourg-sur-Lave furent rappelés.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480331&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c059586-ed0a-4c17-8621-6df51a254d13', 'multiverseId': 480331}, 'multiverseid': 480331}, {'name': 'Capridorio della Tempesta', 'text': 'Volare\\nSe sta per essere inflitto danno non da combattimento al Capridorio della Tempesta, previeni quel danno. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Capridorio della Tempesta per ogni danno prevenuto in questo modo.', 'type': 'Creatura — Capra Uccello', 'flavor': 'Dopo una giornata di battaglia disastrosa, i maghi dei fulmini di Lavariva vennero richiamati.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480590&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e7e13b5-1610-4261-be6c-91c99f1bafd8', 'multiverseId': 480590}, 'multiverseid': 480590}, {'name': '嵐生の飛び山羊', 'text': '飛行\\n嵐生の飛び山羊が戦闘ダメージでないダメージを受けるなら、そのダメージを軽減する。これにより軽減されたダメージ１点につき、嵐生の飛び山羊の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥・ヤギ', 'flavor': '一日続いた悲惨な戦いの後で、ラバブリンクの稲妻魔道士たちは帰還を命じられた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480849&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c32f199-58e1-4b2f-83ba-72a1812eb938', 'multiverseId': 480849}, 'multiverseid': 480849}, {'name': '폭풍야수 카프리도르', 'text': '비행\\n폭풍야수 카프리도르에 비전투피해가 입혀지려 하면, 그 피해를 방지한다. 이런 식으로 방지된 피해 1점당 폭풍야수 카프리도르에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.', 'type': '생물 — 조류 염소', 'flavor': '처참했던 전투가 하루 내내 벌어진 후, 용암가장자리의 번개 마도사들은 복귀 명령을 받았다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481108&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aec008fd-ea16-4350-a762-a7424f2d1290', 'multiverseId': 481108}, 'multiverseid': 481108}, {'name': 'Capridor Tempestuoso', 'text': 'Voar\\nSe algum dano que não seja de combate seria causado a Capridor Tempestuoso, previna aquele dano. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Capridor Tempestuoso para cada 1 ponto de dano prevenido dessa forma.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave Bode', 'flavor': 'Após um dia de batalha desastroso, os magos dos raios de Beiralava bateram em retirada.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481367&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5cc78a9-dd58-488e-91d0-8541b6f0f581', 'multiverseId': 481367}, 'multiverseid': 481367}, {'name': 'Козодор Бушующей Бури', 'text': 'Полет\\nЕсли Козодору Бушующей Бури должны быть нанесены небоевые повреждения, предотвратите те повреждения. За каждое 1 повреждение, предотвращенное таким образом, положите на Козодора Бушующей Бури один жетон +1/+1.', 'type': 'Существо — Птица Коза', 'flavor': 'После сражения, которое обернулось катастрофой, магов молний из Лавобрега отозвали в город.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481626&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89641fb1-5efd-4bd8-bbae-711549fb8e35', 'multiverseId': 481626}, 'multiverseid': 481626}, {'name': '聚风飞羊', 'text': '飞行\\n如果聚风飞羊将受到非战斗伤害，则防止该伤害。每以此法防止1点伤害，便在聚风飞羊上放置一个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～鸟／山羊', 'flavor': '经过一整天的灾难惨败，熔缘城的闪电法师部队奉命撤回。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481885&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa34f9d1-294b-448e-b5d4-48d43559aa97', 'multiverseId': 481885}, 'multiverseid': 481885}, {'name': '聚風飛羊', 'text': '飛行\\n如果聚風飛羊將受到非戰鬥傷害，則防止該傷害。每以此法防止1點傷害，便在聚風飛羊上放置一個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '生物 ～鳥／山羊', 'flavor': '經過一整天的災難慘敗，熔緣城的閃電法師部隊奉命撤回。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482144&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7f9ad58-7336-45c6-8d91-7f8b55abc7bc', 'multiverseId': 482144}, 'multiverseid': 482144}]", '[{\'name\': \'Blutstarre\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Lege eine Bedrohlich-Marke auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst. (Sie kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Furcht durchdringt die stärkste Rüstung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479854&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a58143f0-1966-4bc5-ba87-7f2a3dd284ce\', \'multiverseId\': 479854}, \'multiverseid\': 479854}, {\'name\': \'Helar la sangre\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Pon un contador de amenaza sobre una criatura que controlas. (No puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El miedo atraviesa la armadura más resistente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'883b1b31-4c0e-4d77-93f8-97d4e27de0d1\', \'multiverseId\': 480113}, \'multiverseid\': 480113}, {\'name\': \'Glacement du sang\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature ciblée. Mettez un marqueur « menace » sur une créature que vous contrôlez. (Elle ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La peur peut transpercer les armures les plus solides.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480372&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c8748b9-c204-43df-a3ad-075808f1c5d6\', \'multiverseId\': 480372}, \'multiverseid\': 480372}, {\'name\': \'Raggelare il Sangue\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Metti un segnalino minacciare su una creatura che controlli. (Non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "La paura penetra anche l\'armatura più forte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a580c07-94cc-46b6-a381-c831e76e15dc\', \'multiverseId\': 480631}, \'multiverseid\': 480631}, {\'name\': \'血液凝固\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に威迫カウンターを１個置く。（これは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'恐怖は最強の鎧をも貫く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'586fb581-7036-41d9-8dfd-38a3ba4d0d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 480890}, \'multiverseid\': 480890}, {\'name\': \'혈액 응고\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개에 호전적 카운터를 올려놓는다. (그 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'공포는 가장 강력한 갑옷도 꿰뚫는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36edfee1-e8bd-4494-99dd-b944a627e052\', \'multiverseId\': 481149}, \'multiverseid\': 481149}, {\'name\': \'Coalhar Sangue\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. Coloque um marcador de ameaçar em uma criatura que você controla. (Ela só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O medo atravessa a mais forte das armaduras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'055789be-f919-47c3-b0d9-c2d6830b375b\', \'multiverseId\': 481408}, \'multiverseid\': 481408}, {\'name\': \'Стынущая Кровь\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Положите один жетон Угрозы на существо под вашим контролем. (Оно не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Страх пробивает даже самый прочный доспех.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2511ae7-c4ee-41e0-805c-d4cca3501f7b\', \'multiverseId\': 481667}, \'multiverseid\': 481667}, {\'name\': \'血流凝结\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。在一个由你操控的生物上放置一个威慑指示物。（它只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'恐惧能穿透最厚实的盔甲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6585658c-b77a-4a1d-b47a-4df4165dba0c\', \'multiverseId\': 481926}, \'multiverseid\': 481926}, {\'name\': \'血流凝結\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物。在一個由你操控的生物上放置一個威懾指示物。（它只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'恐懼能穿透最厚實的盔甲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c0b5835-3e20-44fb-a4bf-4dd30d26161f\', \'multiverseId\': 482185}, \'multiverseid\': 482185}]', '[{\'name\': \'Borstiges Wildschwein\', \'text\': \'Das Borstige Wildschwein kann nicht von mehr als einer Kreatur geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wildschwein\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann in Zagoth alles besiegen, doch manche Beute liefert zu viel Kampf und zu wenig Fleisch."\\n—Meisterjäger Chevill\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d7b2b1-e900-474e-a5eb-0734015aa5b3\', \'multiverseId\': 479925}, \'multiverseid\': 479925}, {\'name\': \'Jabalí encrespado\', \'text\': \'El Jabalí encrespado no puede ser bloqueado por más de una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Jabalí\', \'flavor\': \'"Puedo acabar con cualquier cosa de Zagoth, pero hay presas contra las que hay que luchar demasiado para la carne que se obtiene".\\n—Chevill, maestro cazador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca69c7d-a127-4ca9-addd-ccbc2d90dc83\', \'multiverseId\': 480184}, \'multiverseid\': 480184}, {\'name\': \'Sanglier hérissé\', \'text\': "Le Sanglier hérissé ne peut pas être bloqué par plus d\'une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : sanglier\', \'flavor\': "« Je peux chasser n\'importe quelle bête de Zagoth, mais certaines sont trop coriaces pour que ça en vaille la peine. »\\n—Maître chasseur Chévill", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480443&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b876b273-b3f9-4efe-bcd5-f2809251421f\', \'multiverseId\': 480443}, \'multiverseid\': 480443}, {\'name\': \'Cinghiale Irsuto\', \'text\': \'Il Cinghiale Irsuto non può essere bloccato da più di una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cinghiale\', \'flavor\': \'"Posso abbattere qualsiasi creatura di Zagoth, ma per alcune prede il rapporto tra lotta e carne è troppo alto."\\n—Maestro di caccia Chevill\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aafa0567-75e3-437a-ad91-6e9212f7fbec\', \'multiverseId\': 480702}, \'multiverseid\': 480702}, {\'name\': \'逆毛の猪\', \'text\': \'逆毛の猪は、２体以上のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猪\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼイゴスにいるものなら何だって仕留められるが、中には肉が苦労に見合わない獲物もいるんでな。」\\n――練達の狩人、チェビル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e960f8c-47db-4d50-9680-5d2c247994f3\', \'multiverseId\': 480961}, \'multiverseid\': 480961}, {\'name\': \'성난 멧돼지\', \'text\': \'성난 멧돼지는 생물 하나에게만 방어될 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 멧돼지\', \'flavor\': \'"난 자고스에 있는 거라면 어떤 놈이든 쓰러뜨릴 수 있지만, 사냥감 중 몇 놈은 싸워서 얻는 고기 비율이 아주 높지."\\n—사냥의 대가 체빌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'291ad588-96f1-4cbe-bf38-7cff034db94a\', \'multiverseId\': 481220}, \'multiverseid\': 481220}, {\'name\': \'Javali Eriçado\', \'text\': \'Javali Eriçado não pode ser bloqueado por mais de uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Javali\', \'flavor\': \'"Sou capaz de abater qualquer coisa em Zagoth, mas com algumas presasa relação custo-benefício é alta demais."\\n— Mestre Caçador Chevill\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bdb07a5-2502-494e-bbe2-8c12213bfd11\', \'multiverseId\': 481479}, \'multiverseid\': 481479}, {\'name\': \'Щетинистый Вепрь\', \'text\': \'Щетинистый Вепрь не может быть заблокирован более чем одним существом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вепрь\', \'flavor\': \'«Я могу добыть в Заготе что угодно, но с некоторой дичью возни выходит куда больше, чем мяса».\\n— мастер-охотник Чевилл\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8c9b8f6-e0df-4233-af9f-da719266f900\', \'multiverseId\': 481738}, \'multiverseid\': 481738}, {\'name\': \'鬃毛野猪\', \'text\': \'鬃毛野猪不能被多于一个生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野猪\', \'flavor\': \'「札苟斯境内一切怪兽都不是我对手，但有些猎物之肉量贴补不上所耗损的搏斗精力。」\\n～狩猎大师车维尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21018f58-19a8-43ca-939c-da4bc3810b05\', \'multiverseId\': 481997}, \'multiverseid\': 481997}, {\'name\': \'鬃毛野豬\', \'text\': \'鬃毛野豬不能被多於一個生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野豬\', \'flavor\': \'「札苟斯境內一切怪獸都不是我對手，但有些獵物之肉量貼補不上所耗損的搏鬥精力。」\\n～狩獵大師車維爾\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0d341a5-278c-49dc-b68d-b71608f116d9\', \'multiverseId\': 482256}, \'multiverseid\': 482256}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brokkos, Apex der Ewigkeit\', \'text\': \'Mutation {2}o{U/B}{G}{G} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Mutationskosten wirkst, lege ihn auf oder unter eine Nicht-Mensch-Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du besitzt. Sie mutieren zur oben liegenden Kreatur, die zusätzlich alle Fähigkeiten der darunter liegenden hat.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nDu kannst Brokkos, Apex der Ewigkeit, mithilfe seiner Mutation-Fähigkeit aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Bestie, Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3d487d9-315c-4139-b75e-e73d959897b3\', \'multiverseId\': 479958}, \'multiverseid\': 479958}, {\'name\': \'Brokkos, Alfa de la Eternidad\', \'text\': \'Mutación {2}o{U/B}{G}{G}. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de mutación, ponlo sobre o bajo la criatura objetivo que no sea Humano de la cual eres propietario. Estas mutan en la criatura de la parte superior más todas las habilidades de debajo.)\\nArrolla.\\nPuedes lanzar a Brokkos, Alfa de la Eternidad desde tu cementerio usando su habilidad de mutación.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pesadilla bestia elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2c206e7-3584-413f-8040-1d2a206f11fd\', \'multiverseId\': 480217}, \'multiverseid\': 480217}, {\'name\': "Brokkos, Zénith de l\'éternité", \'text\': "Mutation {2}o{U/B}{G}{G} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de mutation, mettez-le au-dessus ou au-dessous d\'une créature non-Humain ciblée que vous possédez. La créature mutante est la créature du dessus, avec toutes les capacités des cartes au-dessous.)\\nPiétinement\\nVous pouvez lancer Brokkos, Zénith de l\'éternité depuis votre cimetière avec sa capacité de mutation.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : cauchemar et bête et élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c460fbb-a230-4904-8d60-b85e28b277ee\', \'multiverseId\': 480476}, \'multiverseid\': 480476}, {\'name\': "Broykos, Alfa dell\'Eternità", \'text\': "Mutazione {2}o{U/B}{G}{G} (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di mutazione, mettila sopra o sotto una creatura non Umano bersaglio che possiedi. Muta nella creatura sopra, con anche le abilità di quelle sotto.)\\nTravolgere\\nPuoi lanciare Broykos, Alfa dell\'Eternità dal tuo cimitero usando la sua abilità mutazione.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Elementale Bestia Incubo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4b53bde-9160-4707-a356-cabd40fb7077\', \'multiverseId\': 480735}, \'multiverseid\': 480735}, {\'name\': \'永遠の頂点、ブロコス\', \'text\': \'変容{2}o{U/B}{G}{G}（あなたがこの呪文をこれの変容コストで唱えるなら、あなたがオーナーであり人間でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれの上か下に置く。これらは、一番上のクリーチャーに、その下にある能力すべてを加えたものに変容する。）\\nトランプル\\nあなたは、あなたの墓地から永遠の頂点、ブロコスを、これの変容能力を使って唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ナイトメア・ビースト・エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4efc216c-bae1-440a-8196-4658df3f5274\', \'multiverseId\': 480994}, \'multiverseid\': 480994}, {\'name\': \'영원의 정점, 브로코스\', \'text\': \'돌연변이화 {2}o{U/B}{G}{G} (당신이 돌연변이화 비용을 지불해 이 주문을 발동한다면, 당신이 소유한 인간이 아닌 생물을 목표로 정한다. 이 카드를 그 생물의 위 또는 아래에 놓는다. 그 생물은 맨 위에 있는 생물이 그 아래에 놓인 카드들의 모든 능력을 가진 생물로 돌연변이화한다.)\\n돌진\\n당신은 영원의 정점, 브로코스의 돌연변이화 능력을 사용해 브로코스를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 나이트메어 야수 정령\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2c526cc-2844-43b3-976d-6611ccd0092b\', \'multiverseId\': 481253}, \'multiverseid\': 481253}, {\'name\': \'Brokkos, Ápice da Eternidade\', \'text\': \'Mutação {2}o{U/B}{G}{G} (Se você conjurar esta mágica pelo custo de mutação, coloque-a sobre ou sob a criatura alvo que você possui que não seja um Humano. Elas sofrem uma mutação que resulta na criatura de cima com todas as habilidades das criaturas de baixo.)\\nAtropelar\\nVocê pode conjurar Brokkos, Ápice da Eternidade, do seu cemitério usando sua habilidade de mutação.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pesadelo Besta Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d60ae81-1303-467d-80b5-f202ab64d227\', \'multiverseId\': 481512}, \'multiverseid\': 481512}, {\'name\': \'Броккос, Венец Вечности\', \'text\': \'Мутация {2}o{U/B}{G}{G} (Если вы разыграли это заклинание за его стоимость Мутации, положите его сверху или снизу целевого принадлежащего вам существа, не являющегося Человеком. Они мутируют в существо сверху, которому добавляются все способности снизу.)\\nПробивной удар\\nВы можете разыгрывать Броккоса, Венец Вечности из вашего кладбища, используя его способность Мутации.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Кошмар Зверь Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b951be06-deef-46c5-9357-facea26b6890\', \'multiverseId\': 481771}, \'multiverseid\': 481771}, {\'name\': \'恒天霸犀布洛寇\', \'text\': \'合变{2}o{U/B}{G}{G}（如果你支付此咒语的合变费用来施放之，则将它放置在目标由你拥有之非人类生物的顶上或底下。它们合变作顶上的生物，外加具有底下所有异能。）\\n践踏\\n你可以从你的坟墓场中利用恒天霸犀布洛寇的合变异能来施放之。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～梦魇／野兽／元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14766eb0-8dbc-4c8b-a8c5-6df2aef9bda5\', \'multiverseId\': 482030}, \'multiverseid\': 482030}, {\'name\': \'恆天霸犀布洛寇\', \'text\': \'合變{2}o{U/B}{G}{G}（如果你支付此咒語的合變費用來施放之，則將它放置在目標由你擁有之非人類生物的頂上或底下。它們合變作頂上的生物，外加具有底下所有異能。）\\n踐踏\\n你可以從你的墳墓場中利用恆天霸犀布洛寇的合變異能來施放之。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～夢魘／野獸／元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b085ff4-0083-42a8-b8cb-ca713a0c45d3\', \'multiverseId\': 482289}, \'multiverseid\': 482289}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brokkos, Apex der Ewigkeit\', \'text\': \'Mutation {2}o{U/B}{G}{G}\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nDu kannst Brokkos, Apex der Ewigkeit, mithilfe seiner Mutation-Fähigkeit aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Bestie, Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Bio-Quarz Spacegodzilla\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208aa9a7-b16f-444e-8dce-37ad25774f73\', \'multiverseId\': 482391}, \'multiverseid\': 482391}, {\'name\': \'Brokkos, Alfa de la Eternidad\', \'text\': \'Mutación {2}o{U/B}{G}{G}.\\nArrolla.\\nPuedes lanzar a Brokkos, Alfa de la Eternidad desde tu cementerio usando su habilidad de mutación.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pesadilla bestia elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Spacegodzilla biocuarzo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccdca40a-fe4c-4d0c-8260-eb233acf2803\', \'multiverseId\': 482405}, \'multiverseid\': 482405}, {\'name\': "Brokkos, Zénith de l\'éternité", \'text\': "Mutation {2}o{U/B}{G}{G}\\nPiétinement\\nVous pouvez lancer Brokkos, Zénith de l\'éternité depuis votre cimetière avec sa capacité de mutation.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : cauchemar et bête et élémental\', \'flavor\': \'Spacegodzilla à bio-quartz\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cf5f5fb-2fed-4ebb-90d7-3359b675cba7\', \'multiverseId\': 482419}, \'multiverseid\': 482419}, {\'name\': "Broykos, Alfa dell\'Eternità", \'text\': "Mutazione {2}o{U/B}{G}{G}\\nTravolgere\\nPuoi lanciare Broykos, Alfa dell\'Eternità dal tuo cimitero usando la sua abilità mutazione.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Elementale Bestia Incubo\', \'flavor\': \'Spacegodzilla al Bioquarzo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'993a3041-f0f5-4496-9df4-94eafafea84e\', \'multiverseId\': 482433}, \'multiverseid\': 482433}, {\'name\': \'永遠の頂点、ブロコス\', \'text\': \'変容{2}o{U/B}{G}{G}\\nトランプル\\nあなたは、あなたの墓地から永遠の頂点、ブロコスを、これの変容能力を使って唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ナイトメア・ビースト・エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'結（けっ）晶（しょう）怪（かい）獣（じゅう）、スペースゴジラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc194e6c-b777-4cce-9f71-7ad03142ee74\', \'multiverseId\': 482447}, \'multiverseid\': 482447}, {\'name\': \'영원의 정점, 브로코스\', \'text\': \'돌연변이화 {2}o{U/B}{G}{G}\\n돌진\\n당신은 영원의 정점, 브로코스의 돌연변이화 능력을 사용해 브로코스를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 나이트메어 야수 정령\', \'flavor\': \'바이오쿼츠 스페이스고질라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'849d0f70-ee9e-41f3-b142-3f79a0e32969\', \'multiverseId\': 482461}, \'multiverseid\': 482461}, {\'name\': \'Brokkos, Ápice da Eternidade\', \'text\': \'Mutação {2}o{U/B}{G}{G}\\nAtropelar\\nVocê pode conjurar Brokkos, Ápice da Eternidade, do seu cemitério usando sua habilidade de mutação.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pesadelo Besta Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Spacegodzilla de Bioquartzo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de9badd0-cc64-498f-9839-af1586c17b25\', \'multiverseId\': 482475}, \'multiverseid\': 482475}, {\'name\': \'Броккос, Венец Вечности\', \'text\': \'Мутация {2}o{U/B}{G}{G}\\nПробивной удар\\nВы можете разыгрывать Броккоса, Венец Вечности из вашего кладбища, используя его способность Мутации.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Кошмар Зверь Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Биокварцевый Космогодзилла\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e46ba060-849c-46fa-a5e4-88aaa5b49321\', \'multiverseId\': 482489}, \'multiverseid\': 482489}, {\'name\': \'恒天霸犀布洛寇\', \'text\': \'合变{2}o{U/B}{G}{G}\\n践踏\\n你可以从你的坟墓场中利用恒天霸犀布洛寇的合变异能来施放之。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～梦魇／野兽／元素\', \'flavor\': \'生化晶兽太空哥斯拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2763adcd-a049-45e2-8c9a-36d38fa42365\', \'multiverseId\': 482503}, \'multiverseid\': 482503}, {\'name\': \'恆天霸犀布洛寇\', \'text\': \'合變{2}o{U/B}{G}{G}\\n踐踏\\n你可以從你的墳墓場中利用恆天霸犀布洛寇的合變異能來施放之。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～夢魘／野獸／元素\', \'flavor\': \'生化晶獸太空哥吉拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b65474-3866-4475-b7da-9ed32cc60753\', \'multiverseId\': 482517}, \'multiverseid\': 482517}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bund der Überlebenden\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Bringe eine Mensch-Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n• Bringe eine Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Und was haben wir daraus gelernt? Ärgere niemals einen Stachelpapagei!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'186aff9e-a523-497e-9506-fadf5a5ebde4\', \'multiverseId\': 479951}, \'multiverseid\': 479951}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo de supervivientes\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o ambos:\\n• Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo Humano de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n• Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo que no sea Humano de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Y qué hemos aprendido? ¡Nada de provocar a un loroespín!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f19fb6da-0a83-430e-94dd-7954fee4742c\', \'multiverseId\': 480210}, \'multiverseid\': 480210}, {\'name\': \'Lien des survivants\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Renvoyez une carte de créature Humain ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\n• Renvoyez une carte de créature non-Humain ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« La leçon ? Ne jamais narguer un psittacérisson ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480469&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'430325f8-c4f8-49fb-83fa-63e07f3fa07a\', \'multiverseId\': 480469}, \'multiverseid\': 480469}, {\'name\': \'Vincolo dei Superstiti\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Riprendi in mano una carta creatura Umano bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n• Riprendi in mano una carta creatura non Umano bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"E cos\\\'abbiamo imparato? Mai deridere un istrigallo!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5e315cb-de86-4bf6-9e97-1c8fe28797a4\', \'multiverseId\': 480728}, \'multiverseid\': 480728}, {\'name\': \'生存者の絆\', \'text\': \'以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• あなたの墓地から人間・クリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n• あなたの墓地から人間でないクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「今回の教訓だ。絶対にヤマオウムは挑発するな！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d6cd808-ba0f-4a88-92c3-48542e1bb015\', \'multiverseId\': 480987}, \'multiverseid\': 480987}, {\'name\': \'생존자들의 유대\', \'text\': \'하나 혹은 둘 다를 선택한다 —\\n• 당신의 무덤에 있는 인간 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\\n• 당신의 무덤에 있는 인간이 아닌 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"우리가 뭘 배웠지? 앵무도치를 도발하지 말라는 거야!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2197b7d6-d9ab-43e3-8d7f-fdeae0f456ad\', \'multiverseId\': 481246}, \'multiverseid\': 481246}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo dos Sobreviventes\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou ambos —\\n• Devolva o card de criatura alvo do tipo Humano de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\n• Devolva o card de criatura alvo que não seja um Humano de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"E o que é que nós aprendemos com isso? Nunca, jamais, provoque um papagaio-espinho!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48d580ed-2f84-4936-bdfc-675e29fd13a9\', \'multiverseId\': 481505}, \'multiverseid\': 481505}, {\'name\': \'Узы Уцелевших\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно или оба —\\n• Верните целевую карту существа-Человека из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\n• Верните целевую карту не являющегося Человеком существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«И чему мы научились? Не стоит дразнить попугобраза!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa7d1e01-be69-4bf6-8522-26635014806e\', \'multiverseId\': 481764}, \'multiverseid\': 481764}, {\'name\': \'求生家羁绊\', \'text\': \'选择一项或都选～\\n•将目标人类生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\n•将目标非人类生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们得到了什么教训？别惹箭羽鹦鹉！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e80ac7d-321a-4686-8f6e-8cc9df539a89\', \'multiverseId\': 482023}, \'multiverseid\': 482023}, {\'name\': \'求生家羈絆\', \'text\': \'選擇一項或都選～\\n•將目標人類生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\\n•將目標非人類生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我們得到了什麼教訓？別惹箭羽鸚鵡！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9386edbf-77e4-4066-a4c5-d08bbc734b9a\', \'multiverseId\': 482282}, \'multiverseid\': 482282}]', '[{\'name\': \'Buschfleisch-Wilderin\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, opfere eine andere Kreatur: Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Widerstandskraft der geopferten Kreatur dazu. Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast noch nie das Fleisch eines Zagoth-Terrorschweins gekostet? Ich habe die besten Preise."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479856&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b0a63f-7fe5-4be4-87a0-1e05e60ebe1b\', \'multiverseId\': 479856}, \'multiverseid\': 479856}, {\'name\': \'Cazadora de carne\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrificar otra criatura: Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la resistencia de esa criatura. Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si nunca has probado el cerdo de las tinieblas de Zagoth, no lo encontrarás más barato que aquí".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b73d1442-1075-44ae-8d93-75e9a9b0f360\', \'multiverseId\': 480115}, \'multiverseid\': 480115}, {\'name\': \'Braconnière de gibier\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, sacrifiez une autre créature : Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à l\'endurance de cette créature. Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous n\'avez jamais goûté au porceterreur de Zagoth, je peux vous faire un bon prix. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480374&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d8dccac-2523-42c1-8520-f08bf4e31900\', \'multiverseId\': 480374}, \'multiverseid\': 480374}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatrice di Frodo di Selvaggina\', \'text\': "{1}, {T}, Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Guadagni punti vita pari alla costituzione di quella creatura. Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se non hai mai assaggiato il suino del terrore di Zagoth, ti faccio il prezzo migliore sulla piazza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f2f40e6-0b04-4721-8bc9-2c26ef27ca03\', \'multiverseId\': 480633}, \'multiverseid\': 480633}, {\'name\': \'野生肉の密猟者\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, 他のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたはそのクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼイゴスの暴れ豚をまだ味わったことがないなら、どこよりもいい値段で売ってあげるわよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36938cdc-f436-477f-99eb-38c74a25a327\', \'multiverseId\': 480892}, \'multiverseid\': 480892}, {\'name\': \'야생고기 밀렵꾼\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, 다른 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 당신은 그 생물의 방어력만큼 생명점을 얻는다. 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"자고스 공포돼지를 먹어본 적이 없으면, 좋은 가격에 넘겨줄게."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'158d75ec-e472-40fe-90be-5a834aa6f2f3\', \'multiverseId\': 481151}, \'multiverseid\': 481151}, {\'name\': \'Caçadora de Carne Selvagem\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, sacrifique outra criatura: Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual à resistência da criatura sacrificada. Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você nunca se banqueteou com um porco-do-terror de Zagoth, eu tenho o melhor preço do mercado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98bf8e2-ac82-45ba-8596-b7ffa2bfda19\', \'multiverseId\': 481410}, \'multiverseid\': 481410}, {\'name\': \'Диколовчая Браконьерша\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте другое существо: вы получаете количество жизней, равное выносливости того существа. Возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Если тебе никогда не доводилось лакомиться заготским страхосвином, то лучшей цены, чем у меня, ты не найдешь».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4a2c3e9-acf1-46a6-9691-5929e71ad8b2\', \'multiverseId\': 481669}, \'multiverseid\': 481669}, {\'name\': \'野味盗猎者\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，牺牲另一个生物：你获得等同于该生物防御力的生命。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「要是你从未尝过札苟斯恐猪的味道，我这里的价格最公道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c47d47f7-30ca-4e29-bcc7-4326f88f292b\', \'multiverseId\': 481928}, \'multiverseid\': 481928}, {\'name\': \'野味盜獵者\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}，犧牲另一個生物：你獲得等同於該生物防禦力的生命。抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「要是你從未嘗過札苟斯恐豬的味道，我這裡的價格最公道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0e2990d-f0e0-479b-8654-43c5470f59fc\', \'multiverseId\': 482187}, \'multiverseid\': 482187}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chevill, Erzfeind der Monster\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls deine Gegner keine bleibenden Karten mit Kopfgeldmarken kontrollieren, lege eine Kopfgeldmarke auf eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl, die bzw. den ein Gegner kontrolliert.\\nImmer wenn eine bleibende Karte, die ein Gegner kontrolliert und auf der eine Kopfgeldmarke liegt, stirbt, erhältst du 3 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03ed4c4e-185d-475f-af77-a58f460fe867\', \'multiverseId\': 479960}, \'multiverseid\': 479960}, {\'name\': \'Chevill, la Pesadilla de los Monstruos\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si tus oponentes no controlan permanentes con contadores de recompensa sobre ellos, pon un contador de recompensa sobre la criatura o planeswalker objetivo que controla un oponente.\\nSiempre que un permanente que controla un oponente con un contador de recompensa sobre él muera, ganas 3 vidas y robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67eaaf52-d5d8-4c43-9cf9-769a53849b85\', \'multiverseId\': 480219}, \'multiverseid\': 480219}, {\'name\': \'Chévill, fléau des monstres\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vos adversaires ne contrôlent pas de permanents avec des marqueurs « prime » sur eux, mettez un marqueur « prime » sur une cible, créature ou planeswalker, qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un permanent avec un marqueur « prime » qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, vous gagnez 3 points de vie et vous piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'830182db-6200-47a0-934b-3b18283dc1ad\', \'multiverseId\': 480478}, \'multiverseid\': 480478}, {\'name\': \'Chevill, Flagello dei Mostri\', \'text\': "Tocco letale\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se i tuoi avversari non controllano permanenti con segnalini taglia, metti un segnalino taglia su una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio controllati da un avversario.\\nOgniqualvolta un permanente con un segnalino taglia controllato da un avversario muore, guadagni 3 punti vita e peschi una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08907bbf-bc97-4aa7-baca-3a35e214f958\', \'multiverseId\': 480737}, \'multiverseid\': 480737}, {\'name\': \'怪物の災厄、チェビル\', \'text\': \'接死\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手が賞金カウンターが置かれているパーマネントをコントロールしていなかった場合、対戦相手がコントロールしている、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とし、それの上に賞金カウンターを１個置く。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしていて賞金カウンターが置かれているパーマネントが１つ死亡するたび、あなたは３点のライフを得てカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fec6e9e-bb07-4a58-a762-96c3a7d7ce22\', \'multiverseId\': 480996}, \'multiverseid\': 480996}, {\'name\': \'괴수들의 재앙, 체빌\', \'text\': \'치명타\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신의 상대들이 현상금 카운터가 놓인 지속물을 조종하지 않는다면, 상대가 조종하는 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표에 현상금 카운터를 올려놓는다.\\n상대가 조종하는 현상금 카운터가 놓인 지속물이 죽을 때마다, 당신은 생명 3점을 얻고 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b3f7714-5813-41ca-a3f7-e45f71ca7886\', \'multiverseId\': 481255}, \'multiverseid\': 481255}, {\'name\': \'Chevill, Ruína dos Monstros\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nNo início de sua manutenção, se seus oponentes não controlarem permanentes com marcadores de recompensa, coloque um marcador de recompensa na criatura ou no planeswalker alvo que um oponente controla.\\nToda vez que uma permanente que um oponente controla com um marcador de recompensa morre, você ganha 3 pontos de vida e compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b5f2caf-6b84-4e59-8d97-8c325e6f22cf\', \'multiverseId\': 481514}, \'multiverseid\': 481514}, {\'name\': \'Чевилл, Бич Монстров\', \'text\': "Смертельное касание\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки, если под контролем ваших оппонентов нет перманентов с жетонами вознаграждения на них, положите один жетон вознаграждения на целевое существо или planeswalker\'а под контролем оппонента.\\nКаждый раз, когда перманент под контролем оппонента с жетоном вознаграждения на нем умирает, вы получаете 3 жизни и берете карту.", \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6002d167-024e-4d5f-b8f1-774d1a308ea6\', \'multiverseId\': 481773}, \'multiverseid\': 481773}, {\'name\': \'怪兽天敌车维尔\', \'text\': \'死触\\n在你的维持开始时，若所有对手均未操控其上有赏金指示物的永久物，则在目标由对手操控的生物或鹏洛客上放置一个赏金指示物。\\n每当一个由对手操控且其上有赏金指示物的永久物死去时，你获得3点生命并抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70dedb50-85ef-4eef-b502-aa36ad9c529e\', \'multiverseId\': 482032}, \'multiverseid\': 482032}, {\'name\': \'怪獸天敵車維爾\', \'text\': \'死觸\\n在你的維持開始時，若所有對手均未操控其上有賞金指示物的永久物，則在目標由對手操控的生物或鵬洛客上放置一個賞金指示物。\\n每當一個由對手操控且其上有賞金指示物的永久物死去時，你獲得3點生命並抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'312d2e34-7613-4f7b-90ee-b25d4a498599\', \'multiverseId\': 482291}, \'multiverseid\': 482291}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demütiger Naturkundler\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Schlüssel, um sich mit Monstern, egal welcher Größe, zu verbinden, ist zu wissen, wo sie gekrault werden wollen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf982f6a-236d-4e9b-9abc-6f664be81d90\', \'multiverseId\': 479939}, \'multiverseid\': 479939}, {\'name\': \'Naturalista humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Usa este maná solo para lanzar un hechizo de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La clave de la vinculación con monstruos, sin importar su tamaño, es saber dónde les gusta que los rasquen".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2515e3e-f2b1-4323-99b6-b9fffd05b12d\', \'multiverseId\': 480198}, \'multiverseid\': 480198}, {\'name\': \'Humble naturaliste\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort de créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Le secret pour former un lien avec un monstre, quelle que soit sa taille, est de savoir où il aime qu\'on le gratte. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480457&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ad0406d-f816-4810-bdfe-601135f3dfe2\', \'multiverseId\': 480457}, \'multiverseid\': 480457}, {\'name\': \'Naturalista Umile\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare una magia creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il segreto per creare un vincolo con i mostri, a prescindere dalle dimensioni, è sapere dove adorano essere grattati."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d098102a-66ea-484c-9627-2948b11786d1\', \'multiverseId\': 480716}, \'multiverseid\': 480716}, {\'name\': \'謙虚な自然主義者\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナは、クリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「怪物との絆を深める秘訣は、どんな大きさであろうと、掻いて欲しがっているところを知ることさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b783f8f9-c999-481b-b821-2272ca387239\', \'multiverseId\': 480975}, \'multiverseid\': 480975}, {\'name\': \'겸손한 자연주의자\', \'text\': \'{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다. 이 마나는 생물 주문을 발동하는 데에만 사용할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"크기와는 상관없이, 괴수와 유대하는 일의 핵심은 그것들이 어디를 긁어 주면 좋아하는 지를 아는 것이다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10af2b3e-9932-4c24-8239-ae41a28325a7\', \'multiverseId\': 481234}, \'multiverseid\': 481234}, {\'name\': \'Naturalista Humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar uma mágica de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"A chave para os vínculos com os monstros, independentemente do tamanho, é saber onde eles gostam de receber carinho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee7ef3cd-526d-4cda-b941-38864fdbddc9\', \'multiverseId\': 481493}, \'multiverseid\': 481493}, {\'name\': \'Скромный Натуралист\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинания существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Ключ к тому, чтобы установить узы с чудовищем, каким бы громадным оно ни было, — это знать, где его почесать».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98150549-2095-4a3f-adac-c3afaf8f09c3\', \'multiverseId\': 481752}, \'multiverseid\': 481752}, {\'name\': \'谦卑归真师\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。此法术力只能用来施放生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「怪兽不论大小，与其建立羁绊的关键都在于弄清楚它们喜欢你挠哪里。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30080123-5aef-462e-8cac-0b8770b26496\', \'multiverseId\': 482011}, \'multiverseid\': 482011}, {\'name\': \'謙卑歸真師\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。此魔法力只能用來施放生物咒語。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「怪獸不論大小，與其建立羈絆的關鍵都在於弄清楚牠們喜歡你搔哪裡。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0f92159-a779-4498-b95a-86566e3c6d83\', \'multiverseId\': 482270}, \'multiverseid\': 482270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Ansturm leiten\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten offen vorzeigen und die vorgezeigten Karten auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6772bc22-f064-4a80-95c1-c9e17fb3fff8\', \'multiverseId\': 479942}, \'multiverseid\': 479942}, {\'name\': \'Liderar la estampida\', \'text\': \'Mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar cualquier cantidad de cartas de criatura que se encuentren entre ellas y poner las cartas mostradas en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e507c46e-b9cb-4a92-afa9-60a0855fb1c5\', \'multiverseId\': 480201}, \'multiverseid\': 480201}, {\'name\': \'En tête de la ruée\', \'text\': "Regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de créature parmi elles et mettre les cartes révélées dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d73fe92d-4436-4763-8b41-fc8b2db91131\', \'multiverseId\': 480460}, \'multiverseid\': 480460}, {\'name\': "Guidare l\'Assalto", \'text\': \'Guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare un qualsiasi numero di carte creatura scelte tra esse e aggiungerle alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6071cfc2-a304-4344-97ba-5d3cdb9481ad\', \'multiverseId\': 480719}, \'multiverseid\': 480719}, {\'name\': \'暴走の先導\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。あなたはその中から望む枚数のクリーチャー・カードを公開してもよい。それらの公開したカードをあなたの手札に加える。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa1a667a-b43f-417b-8f52-605566f7a541\', \'multiverseId\': 480978}, \'multiverseid\': 480978}, {\'name\': \'폭주의 선두\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 다섯 장을 본다. 당신은 그 중에서 생물 카드를 원하는 만큼 공개한 다음 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b109f000-cfca-4fd2-873e-e53616eaaf45\', \'multiverseId\': 481237}, \'multiverseid\': 481237}, {\'name\': \'Guiar o Estouro\', \'text\': \'Olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar qualquer número de cards de criatura dentre eles e colocar os cards revelados na sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4c25f17-1232-4d8a-8390-3c5c091a82a6\', \'multiverseId\': 481496}, \'multiverseid\': 481496}, {\'name\': \'Во Главе Табуна\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать любое количество находящихся среди них карт существ и положить показанные карты в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd4612c1-424b-460f-9324-5dcd3c55bb13\', \'multiverseId\': 481755}, \'multiverseid\': 481755}, {\'name\': \'引领狂奔\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以展示其中任意数量的生物牌，并将所展示的牌置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'373e48f5-7aa7-4085-9f41-d4c29f817326\', \'multiverseId\': 482014}, \'multiverseid\': 482014}, {\'name\': \'引領狂奔\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌。你可以展示其中任意數量的生物牌，並將所展示的牌置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7124f4-f7b8-4230-b9fd-5d38f946aeec\', \'multiverseId\': 482273}, \'multiverseid\': 482273}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Gegner stoppen\', \'text\': \'Verhindere allen Schaden, der in diesem Zug von Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Eure Beute steht jetzt unter meinem Schutz. Verschwindet."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479952&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a0e0ec7-7adb-47ba-8190-5f2511d3f4c5\', \'multiverseId\': 479952}, \'multiverseid\': 479952}, {\'name\': \'Frustrar al enemigo\', \'text\': \'Prevén todo el daño que fueran a hacer este turno las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ahora tu presa está bajo mi custodia. Retírate".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56578175-500c-4102-ac9c-06fd73379a59\', \'multiverseId\': 480211}, \'multiverseid\': 480211}, {\'name\': "Contrarier l\'ennemi", \'text\': \'Prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci par des créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Votre proie est désormais à ma charge. Abandonnez. »\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b37de681-6db5-47ea-a992-ae68f5a98419\', \'multiverseId\': 480470}, \'multiverseid\': 480470}, {\'name\': \'Contrastare il Nemico\', \'text\': \'Previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto in questo turno da creature controllate dai tuoi avversari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La vostra preda ora è sotto la mia protezione. Ritiratevi."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44bd0856-130b-4a3c-ba8c-a93d1dac93db\', \'multiverseId\': 480729}, \'multiverseid\': 480729}, {\'name\': \'敵軍妨害\', \'text\': \'このターン、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーから受けるダメージをすべて軽減する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたの獲物は、私の保護下に入った。諦めなさい。」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3f357ee-1f2e-410a-965d-18d0876d2f47\', \'multiverseId\': 480988}, \'multiverseid\': 480988}, {\'name\': \'적 좌절시키기\', \'text\': \'당신의 상대들이 조종하는 생물들이 이번 턴에 입히려고 하는 모든 피해를 방지한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"네 사냥감은 이제 내가 보호한다. 물러나."\\n—비비안 레이드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1096bf-d278-45a4-a9d6-9d718a3fa38a\', \'multiverseId\': 481247}, \'multiverseid\': 481247}, {\'name\': \'Frustrar o Inimigo\', \'text\': \'Previna todo o dano que seria causado neste turno por criaturas que seus oponentes controlam.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua presa agora está sob minha custódia. Retirem-se."\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05c6aecd-c1aa-4c76-b8d4-b7bc4db67574\', \'multiverseId\': 481506}, \'multiverseid\': 481506}, {\'name\': \'Помешать Врагу\', \'text\': \'Предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены в этом ходу существами под контролем ваших оппонентов.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Ваша добыча теперь под моей защитой. Отступите».\\n— Вивьен Рейд\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bff08ba-d4b5-4013-9634-e03ea16e28e4\', \'multiverseId\': 481765}, \'multiverseid\': 481765}, {\'name\': \'遏阻敌人\', \'text\': \'于本回合中，防止由对手操控之生物将造成的所有伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你们的猎物现在受我保护。退后。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0df7f8d6-251e-4cb5-b183-cd3e5c9d7ec3\', \'multiverseId\': 482024}, \'multiverseid\': 482024}, {\'name\': \'遏阻敵人\', \'text\': \'於本回合中，防止由對手操控之生物將造成的所有傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「你們的獵物現在受我保護。退後。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a78ebca0-0fb9-432a-a9ef-ef04baee1105\', \'multiverseId\': 482283}, \'multiverseid\': 482283}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Ozolith\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, das Spiel verlässt und falls Marken auf ihr lagen, lege jene Marken auf den Ozolith.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls der Ozolith Marken auf sich liegen hat, kannst du alle Marken vom Ozolith auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl bewegen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'So wie er sich dreht, dreht sich auch alles Leben um ihn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4742542-f7db-4a5c-9390-10de052db51b\', \'multiverseId\': 480016}, \'multiverseid\': 480016}, {\'name\': \'El Ozolito\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas deje el campo de batalla, si tenía contadores sobre ella, pon esos contadores sobre El Ozolito.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, si El Ozolito tiene contadores sobre él, puedes mover todos los contadores de El Ozolito a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que cambia, también lo hace la vida que lo rodea.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa637af6-a760-4252-b311-10a5e6de8fd1\', \'multiverseId\': 480275}, \'multiverseid\': 480275}, {\'name\': "L\'Ozolithe", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez quitte le champ de bataille, si elle avait des marqueurs sur elle, mettez ces marqueurs sur L\'Ozolithe.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, si L\'Ozolithe a des marqueurs sur lui, vous pouvez déplacer tous les marqueurs de L\'Ozolithe sur une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire\', \'flavor\': "Lorsqu\'il se déforme, il déforme également la vie qui l\'entoure.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cc5c803-a71f-4159-9f28-975e6758d0f9\', \'multiverseId\': 480534}, \'multiverseid\': 480534}, {\'name\': "L\'Ozolito", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli lascia il campo di battaglia, se aveva segnalini, metti quei segnalini su L\'Ozolito.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se L\'Ozolito ha segnalini, puoi spostare tutti i segnalini da L\'Ozolito su una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario\', \'flavor\': \'Quando si contorce, la vita intorno a lui fa altrettanto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d16956e5-109a-4887-baed-048aad0d9f44\', \'multiverseId\': 480793}, \'multiverseid\': 480793}, {\'name\': \'オゾリス\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体戦場を離れるたび、それの上にカウンターが置かれていた場合、オゾリスの上にそれらのカウンターを置く。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、オゾリスの上にカウンターが置かれていた場合、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはオゾリスの上からすべてのカウンターをそれの上に移動してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それがねじれているように、周囲の命もまたねじれている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c145b2-7e72-47dd-8483-b7557526a5a6\', \'multiverseId\': 481052}, \'multiverseid\': 481052}, {\'name\': \'오조리스\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물이 전장을 떠날 때마다, 그 생물에 카운터가 놓여있었다면, 그 카운터들을 오조리스에 올려놓는다.\\n당신의 턴 전투 시작에, 오조리스에 카운터가 놓여있다면, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 오조리스에 놓여있는 모든 카운터들을 그 생물로 옮길 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'그것이 비틀리자, 그 주변에 있는 모든 생명 또한 그렇게 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebfd5ce2-b280-420a-a1d9-01b331a25030\', \'multiverseId\': 481311}, \'multiverseid\': 481311}, {\'name\': \'O Ozólito\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla deixar o campo de batalha, se ela tiver marcadores, coloque aqueles marcadores em O Ozólito.\\nNo início do combate em seu turno, se O Ozólito tiver marcadores, você pode mover todos os marcadores de O Ozólito para a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme ele se distorce, assim o faz toda vida em seu redor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'945d8188-e951-4165-9a7a-b42ff1785abb\', \'multiverseId\': 481570}, \'multiverseid\': 481570}, {\'name\': \'Озолит\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем покидает поле битвы, если на нем были жетоны, положите те жетоны на Озолит.\\nВ начале боя во время вашего хода, если на Озолите есть жетоны, вы можете переместить все жетоны с Озолита на целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Он закручивается по спирали — и закручивает жизнь вокруг себя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bce1e231-f32e-4c77-a2cf-970a4af69fff\', \'multiverseId\': 481829}, \'multiverseid\': 481829}, {\'name\': \'欧佐晶岩\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物离开战场时，若其上有指示物，则将这些指示物放置在欧佐晶岩上。\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，若欧佐晶岩上有指示物，则你可以将欧佐晶岩上的所有指示物移至目标生物上。\', \'type\': \'传奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'它扭曲之时，牵引周遭生灵一同变化。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7075e25-7a5e-4bef-be5f-f55f6bc39d24\', \'multiverseId\': 482088}, \'multiverseid\': 482088}, {\'name\': \'歐佐晶岩\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的生物離開戰場時，若其上有指示物，則將這些指示物放置在歐佐晶岩上。\\n在你回合的戰鬥開始時，若歐佐晶岩上有指示物，則你可以將歐佐晶岩上的所有指示物移至目標生物上。\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器\', \'flavor\': \'它扭曲之時，牽引週遭生靈一同變化。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa715d3c-4a29-4f32-b9b5-63bbf1c06875\', \'multiverseId\': 482347}, \'multiverseid\': 482347}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diebischer Otter\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Diebische Otter einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Otter\', \'flavor\': \'„Du willst mir erzählen, dass wir ein Jahr damit verbrachten, die Zuflucht gegen Pterosaurier, Ramm-Gnus und Nachtzähne zu sichern … um nun von sowas ausgeraubt zu werden?"\\n—Endris, Drannithischer Magistrat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479848&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cd6da37-850c-4138-8422-39f1774e0a63\', \'multiverseId\': 479848}, \'multiverseid\': 479848}, {\'name\': \'Nutria ladrona\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Nutria ladrona haga daño a un oponente, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Nutria\', \'flavor\': \'"Así que pasamos un año protegiendo el santuario contra pterosaurios, nurñeros y faucesnocturnas... ¿Y qué criatura dices que nos ha robado?".\\n—Endris, magistrada de Drannith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27f64642-4b17-4518-a437-528d89cab8d5\', \'multiverseId\': 480107}, \'multiverseid\': 480107}, {\'name\': \'Loutre voleuse\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que la Loutre voleuse inflige des blessures à un adversaire, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : loutre\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous me dites que nous avons passé un an à protéger le sanctuaire contre des ptérosaures, des gnoucs et des crocs de nuit... Et nous avons été détroussés par quoi ? »\\n—Endris, magistrat de Drannith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480366&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c0be2d3-dfca-4205-84fb-39c91afb93c1\', \'multiverseId\': 480366}, \'multiverseid\': 480366}, {\'name\': \'Lontra Ladra\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Lontra Ladra infligge danno a un avversario, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lontra\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi stai dicendo che abbiamo passato un anno a proteggere il santuario da pterosauri, montognu e zanne notturne... e siamo stati derubati da cosa?"\\n—Endris, magistrato di Drannith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'809ad1dc-a4ea-4435-b665-b6469a627c26\', \'multiverseId\': 480625}, \'multiverseid\': 480625}, {\'name\': \'泥棒カワウソ\', \'text\': \'泥棒カワウソが対戦相手１人にダメージを与えるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — カワウソ\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたは、我々は一年もの間、プテロサウルスからも、羝獣からも、夜牙からも聖域を守ってきたと言っていました。それが……何に略奪されたんですって？」\\n――ドラニスの判事、エンドリス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e261dbb-61db-404b-bd15-8e85e6684873\', \'multiverseId\': 480884}, \'multiverseid\': 480884}, {\'name\': \'도둑질하는 수달\', \'text\': \'도둑질하는 수달이 상대에게 피해를 입힐 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 수달\', \'flavor\': \'"프테로사우루스와 돌진야수, 어둠송곳니들로부터 성소를 보호하는 데 일 년을 썼는데 . . . 지금 뭐에 도둑을 맞았다고 한 겐가?"\\n—드라니스 판사, 엔드리스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84e9f792-10e1-4243-a7ac-2a580ea4787f\', \'multiverseId\': 481143}, \'multiverseid\': 481143}, {\'name\': \'Lontra Ladra\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Lontra Ladra causar dano a um oponente, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lontra\', \'flavor\': \'"Você está me dizendo que passamos um ano tornando o santuário seguro contra pterossauros, gneiros e presas-noturnas... e fomos roubados pelo quê?!"\\n— Endris, magistrada de Drannith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3931a7cd-c37f-4239-9ee1-0f7b7a8609b7\', \'multiverseId\': 481402}, \'multiverseid\': 481402}, {\'name\': \'Вороватая Выдра\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Вороватая Выдра наносит повреждения оппоненту, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Выдра\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты хочешь сказать, что мы год укрепляли убежище против птерозавров, баранолопов и ночезубов... а нас ограбило вот это?»\\n— Эндрис, драннитский магистрат\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da2ab6e1-ed8e-4e1c-98e7-95a2c405de74\', \'multiverseId\': 481661}, \'multiverseid\': 481661}, {\'name\': \'窃獭\', \'text\': \'每当窃獭向任一对手造成伤害时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～水獭\', \'flavor\': \'「我们花了整整一年的时间来加固庇护地，防卫翼龙、羊羚和夜牙兽入侵. . .然后你现在说我们是被什么东西偷了来着？」\\n～卓尼斯官员恩姬丝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22895a24-0baf-4f9c-8eea-6a84bf0366f0\', \'multiverseId\': 481920}, \'multiverseid\': 481920}, {\'name\': \'竊獺\', \'text\': \'每當竊獺向任一對手造成傷害時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～水獺\', \'flavor\': \'「我們花了整整一年的時間來加固庇護地，防衛翼龍、羊羚和夜牙獸入侵. . .然後你現在說我們是被什麼東西偷了來著？」\\n～卓尼斯官員恩姬絲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fa34f91-147d-46d6-b960-9cab213d3b6b\', \'multiverseId\': 482179}, \'multiverseid\': 482179}]', "[{'name': 'Dornwaldfälle', 'text': 'Die Dornwaldfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dornwaldfälle ins Spiel kommen, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480035&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7262bccb-f108-46e2-bf1d-736ba58d40b3', 'multiverseId': 480035}, 'multiverseid': 480035}, {'name': 'Cascadas bosquespinoso', 'text': 'Las Cascadas bosquespinoso entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Cascadas bosquespinoso entren al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480294&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2df5185-c0b0-45c8-a1ff-e86a31fec8d0', 'multiverseId': 480294}, 'multiverseid': 480294}, {'name': 'Chutes de Boisépine', 'text': 'Les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Chutes de Boisépine arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480553&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82d3f446-8646-432e-b947-3e9bf9321240', 'multiverseId': 480553}, 'multiverseid': 480553}, {'name': 'Cascate di Boscorovo', 'text': 'Le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nQuando le Cascate di Boscorovo entrano nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480812&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11bb7e3b-05b5-4342-b2fc-26af9af531d3', 'multiverseId': 480812}, 'multiverseid': 480812}, {'name': '茨森の滝', 'text': '茨森の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n茨森の滝が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481071&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6dd3e00-b3dd-4d99-be12-660313803ed0', 'multiverseId': 481071}, 'multiverseid': 481071}, {'name': '가시숲 폭포', 'text': '가시숲 폭포는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n가시숲 폭포가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n{T}: {G} 또는 {U}를 추가한다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481330&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8997232d-eda6-41ef-8b54-45d9aca462f9', 'multiverseId': 481330}, 'multiverseid': 481330}, {'name': 'Cachoeira dos Espinhos', 'text': 'Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Cachoeira dos Espinhos entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481589&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc54fc9d-1d7b-4015-a61b-cb3868decfb4', 'multiverseId': 481589}, 'multiverseid': 481589}, {'name': 'Водопад Шиполесья', 'text': 'Водопад Шиполесья выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Водопад Шиполесья выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {U}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481848&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85642699-5eb0-499a-a098-0aebe6778c28', 'multiverseId': 481848}, 'multiverseid': 481848}, {'name': '棘林瀑布', 'text': '棘林瀑布须横置进战场。\\n当棘林瀑布进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482107&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16bca014-d479-4ac7-8477-40337100eebb', 'multiverseId': 482107}, 'multiverseid': 482107}, {'name': '棘林瀑布', 'text': '棘林瀑布須橫置進戰場。\\n當棘林瀑布進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482366&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12ab7408-c4a6-4578-97f6-9427c607d7d4', 'multiverseId': 482366}, 'multiverseid': 482366}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drannithische Feuerstecherin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine andere Karte umwandelst, fügt die Drannithische Feuerstecherin jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nUmwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Die erste Verteidigungslinie und die letzte Person, die du verärgern möchtest.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479892&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5e75b71-3ca1-405b-aea4-6e9569c6b715\', \'multiverseId\': 479892}, \'multiverseid\': 479892}, {\'name\': \'Hechicera de Drannith\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo de otra carta, la Hechicera de Drannith hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\nCiclo {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'La primera línea de defensa, y la última persona a la que deseas hacer enfadar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5d5264f-72cc-43ef-b029-383d5c835c55\', \'multiverseId\': 480151}, \'multiverseid\': 480151}, {\'name\': \'Piqueuse de Drannith\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous vous recyclez une autre carte, la Piqueuse de Drannith inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\nRecyclage {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "La première ligne défensive, et la dernière personne qu\'il faut agacer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480410&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f228be-0744-45fa-8cfc-f2634a42c718\', \'multiverseId\': 480410}, \'multiverseid\': 480410}, {\'name\': \'Pungolatrice di Drannith\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta cicli un\'altra carta, la Pungolatrice di Drannith infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\nCiclo {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': "La prima linea di difesa e l\'ultima persona che ti conviene indispettire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03fee871-3525-4973-9151-138eeca5ccc5\', \'multiverseId\': 480669}, \'multiverseid\': 480669}, {\'name\': \'ドラニスの刺突者\', \'text\': \'あなたが他のカードをサイクリングするたび、ドラニスの刺突者は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\nサイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'防衛の最前線にして、怒らせたくない最優先の人物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5691b3f0-a223-4ed8-a4d7-8cda5c6e500b\', \'multiverseId\': 480928}, \'multiverseid\': 480928}, {\'name\': \'드라니스 불침꾼\', \'text\': \'당신이 다른 카드를 순환할 때마다, 드라니스 불침꾼은 각 상대에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n순환 {1} ({1}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'수비의 최전선이자, 화내게 하고 싶지 않은 사람이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49c9ca26-18da-4826-95a1-88271ace777c\', \'multiverseId\': 481187}, \'multiverseid\': 481187}, {\'name\': \'Ferroadora de Drannith\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você recicla outro card, Ferroadora de Drannith causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\\nReciclar {1} ({1}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'A primeira linha de defesa. A última pessoa que você deve enfurecer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf040786-82b6-4eac-80c9-4cbb67386e6c\', \'multiverseId\': 481446}, \'multiverseid\': 481446}, {\'name\': \'Драннитская Уязвительница\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы совершаете Цикл другой карты, Драннитская Уязвительница наносит 1 повреждение каждому оппоненту.\\nЦикл {1} ({1}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Первая линия обороны и последняя, кого вы хотели бы рассердить.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'413843a3-db3e-46d4-ab2e-998eb8649434\', \'multiverseId\': 481705}, \'multiverseid\': 481705}, {\'name\': \'卓尼斯术击师\', \'text\': \'每当你循环另一张牌时，卓尼斯术击师向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\\n循环{1}（{1}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'他是你的最前线守卫，也是你最不想惹恼的人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db4ce1c1-53c7-4de1-b2fe-e9c5555c539c\', \'multiverseId\': 481964}, \'multiverseid\': 481964}, {\'name\': \'卓尼斯術擊師\', \'text\': \'每當你循環另一張牌時，卓尼斯術擊師向每位對手各造成1點傷害。\\n循環{1}（{1}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'他是你的最前線守衛，也是你最不想惹惱的人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82e84d39-c18d-4a08-96b0-1637d0617495\', \'multiverseId\': 482223}, \'multiverseid\': 482223}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drannithischer Heiler\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine andere Karte umwandelst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\nUmwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Glimmsteine funkeln und Dinosaurier brüllen gen Süden. Es wird viel zu tun geben heute Nacht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479789&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ccacab6-180c-40dd-901c-5600ac5b9814\', \'multiverseId\': 479789}, \'multiverseid\': 479789}, {\'name\': \'Sanador de Drannith\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo de otra carta, ganas 1 vida.\\nCiclo {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Las rocas irradialuz brillan y los dinosaurios rugen al sur. Esta noche tendremos mucho trabajo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7359fda8-0df5-4bc8-b10c-a6271ece11c9\', \'multiverseId\': 480048}, \'multiverseid\': 480048}, {\'name\': \'Guérisseur de Drannith\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous recyclez une autre carte, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\nRecyclage {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Les nitescenthes brillent et les dinosaures rugissent au sud. Ce soir, on ne va pas chômer. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480307&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8b33232-7f9c-449b-9f06-c56c249e7e19\', \'multiverseId\': 480307}, \'multiverseid\': 480307}, {\'name\': \'Guaritore di Drannith\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta cicli un\'altra carta, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\nCiclo {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Le splendipietre brillano e i dinosauri ruggiscono verso sud. Stanotte gli affari andranno a gonfie vele."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c1e3f05-8790-40e9-b5f2-892b79b8f492\', \'multiverseId\': 480566}, \'multiverseid\': 480566}, {\'name\': \'ドラニスの癒し手\', \'text\': \'あなたが他のカードをサイクリングするたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\nサイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「輝き石が光り、恐竜は南を向いて吼えている。今夜は商売繁盛だろうな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4ab7b41-4158-4df6-bde6-39b7cee546d6\', \'multiverseId\': 480825}, \'multiverseid\': 480825}, {\'name\': \'드라니스 치유사\', \'text\': \'당신이 다른 카드를 순환할 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n순환 {1} ({1}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'"발광석들에서 빛이 나고 공룡들은 남쪽을 향해 울부짖고 있어. 오늘 밤에는 일이 바쁘겠군."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf39f6c-4098-47c9-8a70-7d1ece8ee735\', \'multiverseId\': 481084}, \'multiverseid\': 481084}, {\'name\': \'Curandeiro de Drannith\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você recicla outro card, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\nReciclar {1} ({1}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Luminólitos brilhando e dinossauros rugindo ao sul... Esta noite vai ser ótima para os meus negócios."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab04dae6-63c0-4c40-be4e-da2d98ad2727\', \'multiverseId\': 481343}, \'multiverseid\': 481343}, {\'name\': \'Драннитский Целитель\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы совершаете Цикл другой карты, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\nЦикл {1} ({1}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Светокамни сияют, на юге ревут динозавры. Ночью придется потрудиться».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3cecca9-16ba-4342-96ec-e1d4bdd4afaf\', \'multiverseId\': 481602}, \'multiverseid\': 481602}, {\'name\': \'卓尼斯治疗师\', \'text\': \'每当你循环另一张牌时，你获得1点生命。\\n循环{1}（{1}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「光晶闪耀辉芒，恐龙朝南怒吼。看来今晚要忙了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc360a76-bcda-4bb5-8aee-2c03b427421b\', \'multiverseId\': 481861}, \'multiverseid\': 481861}, {\'name\': \'卓尼斯治療師\', \'text\': \'每當你循環另一張牌時，你獲得1點生命。\\n循環{1}（{1}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「光晶閃耀輝芒，恐龍朝南怒吼。看來今晚要忙了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa464c3-9d99-4eeb-b3e9-fce132286627\', \'multiverseId\': 482120}, \'multiverseid\': 482120}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drannithischer Magistrat\', \'text\': \'Deine Gegner können Zaubersprüche von nirgendwoher außer aus ihrer Hand wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Unsere Zufluchtsorte müssen Leuchtfeuer der Vernunft und der Ruhe sein, oder sie werden fallen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479790&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a809993-4028-4f2a-8283-1a493d825748\', \'multiverseId\': 479790}, \'multiverseid\': 479790}, {\'name\': \'Magistrado de Drannith\', \'text\': \'Tus oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos excepto desde sus manos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nuestros santuarios deben ser faros de la razón y la calma o caerán".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbd17dbf-1589-4513-8141-e01316c78e76\', \'multiverseId\': 480049}, \'multiverseid\': 480049}, {\'name\': \'Magistrat de Drannith\', \'text\': \'Vos adversaires ne peuvent lancer des sorts que depuis leurs mains.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Nos sanctuaires doivent être des bastions de raison et de tranquillité, sinon ils tomberont. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480308&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9496997-bfb3-41ba-9259-c497db5091cd\', \'multiverseId\': 480308}, \'multiverseid\': 480308}, {\'name\': \'Magistrato di Drannith\', \'text\': \'I tuoi avversari non possono lanciare magie da una zona diversa dalla loro mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I nostri santuari devono essere fari di ragionevolezza e calma, oppure cadranno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a71484d-f3ae-4359-a0f1-76a375a8369d\', \'multiverseId\': 480567}, \'multiverseid\': 480567}, {\'name\': \'ドラニスの判事\', \'text\': \'対戦相手は自分の手札以外から呪文を唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「我々の聖域は使命と平穏の標でなくては滅びてしまう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51746ccb-b758-4db4-ae7e-ac96f6e91e18\', \'multiverseId\': 480826}, \'multiverseid\': 480826}, {\'name\': \'드라니스 판사\', \'text\': \'당신의 상대들은 자신의 손 이외의 영역에서는 주문을 발동할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"우리의 성소들은 이성과 침착함의 봉화가 되어야만 해. 그렇지 않으면 무너질 거야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a509e8ee-f76a-4635-a314-4fa20bed81b8\', \'multiverseId\': 481085}, \'multiverseid\': 481085}, {\'name\': \'Magistrado de Drannith\', \'text\': \'Seus oponentes não podem conjurar mágicas de nenhum lugar além da própria mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Nossos santuários precisam ser faróis de racionalidade e calma, ou cairão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80fd67e-b90f-40e6-8367-533258c4325a\', \'multiverseId\': 481344}, \'multiverseid\': 481344}, {\'name\': \'Драннитский Магистрат\', \'text\': \'Ваши оппоненты могут разыгрывать заклинания только из своей руки.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Наши убежища должны быть светочами порядка и спокойствия, иначе они падут».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35c36929-8466-4748-8c00-34105cdc2428\', \'multiverseId\': 481603}, \'multiverseid\': 481603}, {\'name\': \'卓尼斯官员\', \'text\': \'所有对手都不能从其手牌以外的区域施放咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们各处庇护地必须成为理性沉着的信标，否则必将败亡。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad6b8cb-30b8-478c-9093-92428cada2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 481862}, \'multiverseid\': 481862}, {\'name\': \'卓尼斯官員\', \'text\': \'所有對手都不能從其手牌以外的區域施放咒語。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我們各處庇護地必須成為理性沉著的信標，否則必將敗亡。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7306203-0df2-4792-9ad2-aef152b63644\', \'multiverseId\': 482121}, \'multiverseid\': 482121}]', "[{'name': 'Dschungellichtung', 'text': 'Die Dschungellichtung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Dschungellichtung ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480028&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd9eeb031-1f91-485e-b0aa-d85e9c2885fa', 'multiverseId': 480028}, 'multiverseid': 480028}, {'name': 'Hondonada selvática', 'text': 'La Hondonada selvática entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Hondonada selvática entre al campo de batalla, ganas 1 vida.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480287&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfeb4842-c7d5-4611-828b-89fa30526a5e', 'multiverseId': 480287}, 'multiverseid': 480287}, {'name': 'Dépression de jungle', 'text': 'La Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Dépression de jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480546&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9620cbd4-4109-47b6-bcfc-1bf8741509a6', 'multiverseId': 480546}, 'multiverseid': 480546}, {'name': 'Conca nella Giungla', 'text': 'La Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Conca nella Giungla entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480805&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c07bdf25-63ba-4c1e-8f5c-da791b41387d', 'multiverseId': 480805}, 'multiverseid': 480805}, {'name': 'ジャングルのうろ穴', 'text': 'ジャングルのうろ穴はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nジャングルのうろ穴が戦場に出たとき、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481064&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd0572d5-2cd0-4605-aea8-362b1f895c9a', 'multiverseId': 481064}, 'multiverseid': 481064}, {'name': '정글 골짜기', 'text': '정글 골짜기는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n정글 골짜기가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n{T}: {B} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481323&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11e93e7d-39ff-4fbe-8570-f525d49c66d1', 'multiverseId': 481323}, 'multiverseid': 481323}, {'name': 'Clareira na Selva', 'text': 'Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Clareira na Selva entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481582&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c61087d4-4eea-4778-816d-b95ff9e800b7', 'multiverseId': 481582}, 'multiverseid': 481582}, {'name': 'Лощина в Джунглях', 'text': 'Лощина в Джунглях выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Лощина в Джунглях выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481841&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be05f706-da6b-4d3f-8933-3e8e4cb656a6', 'multiverseId': 481841}, 'multiverseid': 481841}, {'name': '丛林幽谷', 'text': '丛林幽谷须横置进战场。\\n当丛林幽谷进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482100&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '989c2648-4324-402f-8c7c-653cd8315c92', 'multiverseId': 482100}, 'multiverseid': 482100}, {'name': '叢林幽谷', 'text': '叢林幽谷須橫置進戰場。\\n當叢林幽谷進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482359&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e3a7970-f1b1-41b8-8953-be454a576934', 'multiverseId': 482359}, 'multiverseid': 482359}]", '[{\'name\': \'Duell der Titanen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kämpft gegen eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl. (Jede der Kreaturen fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Lass die Viecher kämpfen. Wenn sie sich gegenseitig töten, verlieren wir heute keine Soldaten mehr."\\n—Orthion, Lavagrund-Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'798d44eb-0e30-489c-9f91-a777f920e928\', \'multiverseId\': 479890}, \'multiverseid\': 479890}, {\'name\': \'Batalla de titanes\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo lucha contra otra criatura objetivo. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que luchen los salvajes. Si se matan entre ellos, hoy ya no perderemos más soldados".\\n—Orthion, capitán de Bordelava\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'353cdfb2-f255-45a6-b30d-80d64d1c430e\', \'multiverseId\': 480149}, \'multiverseid\': 480149}, {\'name\': \'Choc des titans\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée se bat contre une autre créature ciblée. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Laissez ces brutes se battre. Si elles s\'entretuent, nous ne perdrons pas d\'autres soldats aujourd\'hui. »\\n—Orthion, capitaine de Bourg-sur-Lave", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480408&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01c22ddb-2e65-443e-92c3-866f98773d13\', \'multiverseId\': 480408}, \'multiverseid\': 480408}, {\'name\': \'Scontro tra Titani\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio lotta con un\'altra creatura bersaglio. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lasciate che i bruti combattano. Se si uccidono a vicenda, oggi non perderemo altri soldati."\\n—Orthion, capitano di Lavariva\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70014339-77f0-400e-b3ee-cad4f19f2b66\', \'multiverseId\': 480667}, \'multiverseid\': 480667}, {\'name\': \'巨獣の激突\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体と他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あの獣たちは戦わせておけ。互いに殺し合ってくれれば、今日これ以上兵を失うこともない。」\\n――ラバブリンクの隊長、オーシオン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8c4d1de-f153-40f1-b0af-0306d70d6b47\', \'multiverseId\': 480926}, \'multiverseid\': 480926}, {\'name\': \'거신들의 격돌\', \'text\': \'생물과 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 두 생물은 서로 싸운다. (각 생물은 서로에게 각자의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"서로 싸우게 둬라. 저것들이 서로 죽이면, 오늘은 병사를 더 이상 잃지 않아도 되니까."\\n—용암가장자리 대장, 오르티온\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c183a1b-fb21-4e04-a3d8-38c9a9113423\', \'multiverseId\': 481185}, \'multiverseid\': 481185}, {\'name\': \'Batalha dos Titãs\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo luta com outra criatura alvo. (Cada uma causa dano igual ao seu poder à outra.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Deixe os brutamontes lutarem. Se eles se matarem não perderemos mais soldados hoje."\\n— Orthion, capitão de Beiralava\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f1284ad-dcbf-478f-b4ad-392b054fd4f0\', \'multiverseId\': 481444}, \'multiverseid\': 481444}, {\'name\': \'Битва Титанов\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо дерется с другим целевым существом. (Они наносят друг другу повреждения, равные своей силе.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть громилы дерутся. Если прикончат друг друга, мы сегодня больше никого не потеряем».\\n— Ортион, капитан Лавобрега\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c04b6ac-c501-46e8-984b-7e76e8af52ac\', \'multiverseId\': 481703}, \'multiverseid\': 481703}, {\'name\': \'巨物相争\', \'text\': \'目标生物与另一个目标生物互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「先让怪兽互相残杀。如果它们同归于尽，我们今天就不会死人了。」\\n～熔缘城队长欧席因\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f524131-c357-4cf9-b914-41ee98f85311\', \'multiverseId\': 481962}, \'multiverseid\': 481962}, {\'name\': \'巨物相爭\', \'text\': \'目標生物與另一個目標生物互鬥。（它們各向對方造成等同於本身力量的傷害。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「先讓怪獸互相殘殺。如果牠們同歸於盡，我們今天就不會死人了。」\\n～熔緣城隊長歐席因\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea59512a-bbd5-44b2-9314-26763b656ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 482221}, \'multiverseid\': 482221}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchrammen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu. Falls die Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, Trampelschaden verursacht, wird überschüssiger Schaden stattdessen dem Beherrscher der Kreatur zugefügt.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich brauche einen Sanitäter! Und ein paar Maurer!"\\n—Wyllon, Drannithischer Händler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479949&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'908c8e53-c9b5-425b-8791-902cee24f801\', \'multiverseId\': 479949}, \'multiverseid\': 479949}, {\'name\': \'Arremeter\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a la criatura objetivo que no controlas. Si la criatura que controlas tiene la habilidad de arrollar, en vez de eso, el daño sobrante se hace al controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Necesito un médico! ¡Y algunos albañiles!".\\n—Wyllon, mercader de Drannith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa87201-5d74-457c-88f8-35e9c2373029\', \'multiverseId\': 480208}, \'multiverseid\': 480208}, {\'name\': \'Coup de bélier\', \'text\': \'Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. Si la créature que vous contrôlez a le piétinement, les blessures supplémentaires sont infligées au contrôleur de cette créature à la place.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai besoin d\'un carabin ! Et de maçons ! »\\n—Wyllon, marchand de Drannith", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75a398b1-2f4d-4d70-94db-f14397ba618f\', \'multiverseId\': 480467}, \'multiverseid\': 480467}, {\'name\': \'Incornare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli infligge danno pari alla sua forza a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. Se la creatura che controlli ha travolgere, il danno in eccesso viene invece inflitto al controllore di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Serve un medico! E dei tagliapietre!"\\n—Wyllon, mercante di Drannith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8136b595-0ffc-4fc7-b462-0d4eecde14af\', \'multiverseId\': 480726}, \'multiverseid\': 480726}, {\'name\': \'強行突破\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者に、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。その前者がトランプルを持っているなら、余剰のダメージは、代わりにそのクリーチャーのコントローラーに与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「衛生兵を呼んでくれ！石工もだ！」\\n――ドラニスの商人、ウィロン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7ac342b-f189-4d7d-901d-5d3b44c80a51\', \'multiverseId\': 480985}, \'multiverseid\': 480985}, {\'name\': \'들이받고 지나가기\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물과 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 첫 번째 목표는 두 번째 목표에게 자신의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다. 첫 번째 목표가 돌진을 가지고 있다면, 여분의 피해는 대신 그 생물의 조종자에게 입혀진다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"의무병이 필요해! 그리고 석공들도!"\\n—드라니스 상인, 윌론\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28ca275e-1ff7-4e87-9b6c-463bed9b573a\', \'multiverseId\': 481244}, \'multiverseid\': 481244}, {\'name\': \'Carneirada\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla causa dano igual ao seu poder à criatura alvo que você não controla. Se a criatura que você controla tem atropelar, em vez disso, o dano excedente é causado ao controlador da outra criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Chamem os paramédicos! E uns pedreiros também!"\\n— Wyllon, comerciante de Drannith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'177b5dbe-d5e1-442d-9ef6-92fe3784ffdc\', \'multiverseId\': 481503}, \'multiverseid\': 481503}, {\'name\': \'Снести с Ног\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, целевому существу не под вашим контролем. Если у существа под вашим контролем есть Пробивной удар, то избыточные повреждения вместо этого наносятся контролирующему то существо игроку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Тут нужен доктор! И бригада каменщиков!»\\n— Виллон, драннитский купец\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c2c2355-64af-4164-a517-36e0d4e94476\', \'multiverseId\': 481762}, \'multiverseid\': 481762}, {\'name\': \'轰然撞倒\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物对目标不由你操控的生物造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。如果该由你操控的生物具有践踏异能，则过量伤害改为对后者生物的操控者造成之。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「医生快来！还有石匠！」\\n～卓尼斯商人沃伦\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77d52f77-3085-4612-8e9d-882ac35998e1\', \'multiverseId\': 482021}, \'multiverseid\': 482021}, {\'name\': \'轟然撞倒\', \'text\': \'目標由你操控的生物對目標不由你操控的生物造成傷害，其數量等同於前者的力量。如果該由你操控的生物具有踐踏異能，則過量傷害改為對後者生物的操控者造成之。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「醫生快來！還有石匠！」\\n～卓尼斯商人沃倫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'391beb7d-7007-43f9-9815-f27917186988\', \'multiverseId\': 482280}, \'multiverseid\': 482280}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsterer Handel\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm zwei davon auf deine Hand und lege die andere auf deinen Friedhof. Der Düstere Handel fügt dir 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wilderer machen ihr Geschäft nicht mit Monsterteilen, sondern mit Geschichten. Die Leute bezahlen, um Teil des Abenteuers zu sein."\\n—Kelsien der Verseuchte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'794bfd0b-3537-45fb-9ed7-ee36ad74d39c\', \'multiverseId\': 479861}, \'multiverseid\': 479861}, {\'name\': \'Intercambio oscuro\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon dos de ellas en tu mano y la otra en tu cementerio. El Intercambio oscuro te hace 2 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El cazador furtivo no vive de las partes de monstruos, sino de su propio mito. La gente paga por formar parte de esa fantasía".\\n—Kelsien, la Plaga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dde24242-9719-461e-9b4a-a2824ce3670f\', \'multiverseId\': 480120}, \'multiverseid\': 480120}, {\'name\': \'Obscur marché\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez deux d\'entre elles dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière. L\'Obscur marché vous inflige 2 blessures.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Les braconniers ne vendent pas des morceaux de monstre. Ils vendent des mythes. Les gens paient pour faire partie de la légende. »\\n—Kelsien, la Peste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480379&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd0e0f7b-6744-4b58-ad5d-c69011f5411d\', \'multiverseId\': 480379}, \'multiverseid\': 480379}, {\'name\': \'Transazione Oscura\', \'text\': "Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine due alla tua mano e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero. La Transazione Oscura ti infligge 2 danni.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mestiere del cacciatore di frodo non prospera sui trofei dei mostri in sé, ma sul mito. La gente paga per sentirsi parte della leggenda."\\n—Kelsien, la Piaga\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27628691-0359-4f59-9d2b-8dadbfbaa1f6\', \'multiverseId\': 480638}, \'multiverseid\': 480638}, {\'name\': \'闇の取り引き\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。そのうち２枚をあなたの手札に加え、他の１枚をあなたの墓地に置く。闇の取り引きはあなたに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「その密猟者が扱っているのは怪物の体じゃない。神話だ。人々は物語の一部となるために金を払うんだ。」\\n――疫病をもたらす者、ケルシン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f9fb5c1-29c2-4b8f-a7c3-0772e4efb987\', \'multiverseId\': 480897}, \'multiverseid\': 480897}, {\'name\': \'사악한 거래\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 두 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 다른 한 장은 당신의 무덤에 넣는다. 사악한 거래는 당신에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"밀렵꾼이 거래하는 건 괴수들의 부위가 아니야. 신화를 파는 거지. 사람들은 이야기의 일부가 되고 싶어서 돈을 내는 거야."\\n—역병, 켈시엔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2791126c-5fdc-4c3a-a2fe-d0f352d0e3e0\', \'multiverseId\': 481156}, \'multiverseid\': 481156}, {\'name\': \'Barganha Sombria\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque dois deles em sua mão e o outro em seu cemitério. Barganha Sombria causa 2 pontos de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os caçadores não lucram vendendo pedaços de monstros, mas sim mitos. As pessoas pagam para fazer parte da fantasia."\\n— Kelsien, a Peste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'616dc1e8-fadb-4581-ae67-dfb3cb9cc76e\', \'multiverseId\': 481415}, \'multiverseid\': 481415}, {\'name\': \'Темная Сделка\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите две из них в вашу руку, а оставшуюся — на ваше кладбище. Темная Сделка наносит вам 2 повреждения.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Товар браконьера — это не части тела чудовищ. Это миф. Люди платят, чтобы приобщиться к фантазии».\\n— Келсиен, Моровая Погибель\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63675073-cf53-43ce-9576-296ff1f63105\', \'multiverseId\': 481674}, \'multiverseid\': 481674}, {\'name\': \'黯境交易\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中两张置于你手上，另一张则置入你的坟墓场。黯境交易对你造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「偷猎者卖的不是怪兽奇异身躯，而是狩猎故事。人们愿意付钱来成为轶事的一个环节。」\\n～疫病凯鑫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2077f82d-c390-4cb0-bb19-6b4c1a3f23b1\', \'multiverseId\': 481933}, \'multiverseid\': 481933}, {\'name\': \'黯境交易\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中兩張置於你手上，另一張則置入你的墳墓場。黯境交易對你造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「偷獵者賣的不是怪獸奇異身軀，而是狩獵故事。人們願意付錢來成為軼事的一個環節。」\\n～疫病凱鑫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ea70e4-c92b-4fbe-8d2b-477b80634666\', \'multiverseId\': 482192}, \'multiverseid\': 482192}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsternis-Schuppentier\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Schuppentier\', \'flavor\': \'„Angeblich ernährt es sich rein biolumineszent. Es ist nur in den dunkelsten Nächten von Indatha aktiv, was eine Überprüfung sehr erschwert."\\n—Gannet, Himmelstadt-Zoologe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad03cec-6c2c-49f7-b530-c0ea5fc49121\', \'multiverseId\': 479868}, \'multiverseid\': 479868}, {\'name\': \'Pangolín de las tinieblas\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pangolín pesadilla\', \'flavor\': \'"Dicen que se alimenta únicamente de seres bioluminiscentes. Solo está activo durante las horas más oscuras de las noches de Indatha, por lo que verificar esa creencia es tremendamente difícil".\\n—Gánet, zoólogo de Puertoaéreo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bed08b2-e20a-49aa-b614-842d11f9f279\', \'multiverseId\': 480127}, \'multiverseid\': 480127}, {\'name\': \'Pangolin des ténèbres\', \'type\': \'Créature : cauchemar et pangolin\', \'flavor\': "« Il semblerait être capable de survivre en se nourrissant de bioluminescence. Il n\'est actif que pendant les nuits les plus sombres d\'Indatha, ce qui le rend difficile à identifier. »\\n—Gannet, zoologue de Vogueciel", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480386&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2950873a-24ca-4019-9664-5e0d903c8433\', \'multiverseId\': 480386}, \'multiverseid\': 480386}, {\'name\': \'Pangolino Tetro\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pangolino Incubo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dicono che sopravviva con una dieta strettamente bioluminescente. È attivo solo nelle notti più buie di Indatha, il che rende la verifica alquanto complessa."\\n—Gannet, zoologo della Solcanembi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e5ed00c-abdb-434a-a8a3-93101815816e\', \'multiverseId\': 480645}, \'multiverseid\': 480645}, {\'name\': \'薄暗がりのセンザンコウ\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア・センザンコウ\', \'flavor\': \'「生発光性の餌を食べるとされているが、インダサの夜でも最も暗い時間帯にしか活動しないので、その検証は非常に困難なんだ。」\\n――スカイセイルの動物学者、ガネット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed8d3140-01da-4c50-bb3a-9f075a0a87eb\', \'multiverseId\': 480904}, \'multiverseid\': 480904}, {\'name\': \'음울한 천산갑\', \'type\': \'생물 — 나이트메어 천산갑\', \'flavor\': \'"사람들은 그것이 순전히 생체 발광 식단에만 의지해 살아간다고 하지. 그건 인다타의 가장 어두운 밤중에만 돌아다녀서, 식별하기가 엄청나게 힘들어."\\n—창공돛 동물학자, 가넷\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3fe3d3-a555-4b25-b832-03e328c268d8\', \'multiverseId\': 481163}, \'multiverseid\': 481163}, {\'name\': \'Pangolim Sombrio\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadelo Pangolim\', \'flavor\': \'"Dizem que ele vive de uma dieta puramente bioluminescente. Ele só aparece nas noites mais densas de Indatha, o que torna a verificação dessa informação deveras complicada."\\n— Gannet, zoólogo da Vela Celeste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2f3f07-5126-4ed3-a1a1-b39daedc878a\', \'multiverseId\': 481422}, \'multiverseid\': 481422}, {\'name\': \'Панголин Мрака\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошмар Панголин\', \'flavor\': \'«Говорят, он питается исключительно биолюминесцентными организмами. Проверить это сложно, ведь он активен только самыми темными индатскими ночами».\\n— Ганнет, зоолог Небесного Паруса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65ea9faf-1a20-41b1-9928-0e04fbf48907\', \'multiverseId\': 481681}, \'multiverseid\': 481681}, {\'name\': \'幽光穿山甲\', \'type\': \'生物 ～梦魇／穿山甲\', \'flavor\': \'「他们说这东西仅靠吃发光生物来维生。它只在因达沙最黑暗的夜晚中活动，因此要验证这点也变得十分困难。」\\n～翔空城动物学家加涅特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82c7b7eb-1304-421e-a074-234d29907e77\', \'multiverseId\': 481940}, \'multiverseid\': 481940}, {\'name\': \'幽光穿山甲\', \'type\': \'生物 ～夢魘／穿山甲\', \'flavor\': \'「他們說這東西僅靠吃發光生物來維生。牠只在因達沙最黑暗的夜晚中活動，因此要驗證這點也變得十分困難。」\\n～翔空城動物學家加涅特\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b2ad34d-2015-4f07-9eb7-607d99bc0586\', \'multiverseId\': 482199}, \'multiverseid\': 482199}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsterzahn-Mentorin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Düsterzahn-Mentorin ins Spiel kommt, lege eine Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf eine Nicht-Mensch-Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Lege auf jede Kreatur mit Lebensverknüpfung, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich sehe, was sie sieht. Ich schmecke, was sie schmeckt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=479865&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a672dd-1b37-40bd-81fc-e9554c89915a\', \'multiverseId\': 479865}, \'multiverseid\': 479865}, {\'name\': \'Mentora de colmillos vespertinos\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Mentora de colmillos vespertinos entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador de vínculo vital sobre la criatura objetivo que no sea Humano que controlas.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas con la habilidad de vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo que ella ve, lo veo yo. Lo que ella prueba, lo pruebo yo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d97cb99-55fc-4f83-b443-1d3c17463856\', \'multiverseId\': 480124}, \'multiverseid\': 480124}, {\'name\': \'Mentor crépuscroc\', \'text\': \'Quand la Mentor crépuscroc arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur « lien de vie » sur une créature non-Humain ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature avec le lien de vie que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Je vois ce qu\'elle voit. Je goûte ce qu\'elle goûte. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480383&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7766df71-d203-4072-bd91-e9b0172d1ae9\', \'multiverseId\': 480383}, \'multiverseid\': 480383}, {\'name\': \'Mentore della Zanna Tetra\', \'text\': \'Quando la Mentore della Zanna Tetra entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino legame vitale su una creatura non Umano bersaglio che controlli.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura con legame vitale che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Vedo quello che vede lei e sento il gusto di quello che mangia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62009d49-9894-41b9-8d50-de4070983ac3\', \'multiverseId\': 480642}, \'multiverseid\': 480642}, {\'name\': \'暮れ牙の導師\', \'text\': \'暮れ牙の導師が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に絆魂カウンターを１個置く。\\n{1}{B}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていて絆魂を持つ各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女が見るものは、私も見る。彼女が味わうものは、私も味わう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=480901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c103f449-35ed-41a4-8a55-c63814d1c425\', \'multiverseId\': 480901}, \'multiverseid\': 480901}, {\'name\': \'황혼송곳니 스승\', \'text\': \'황혼송곳니 스승이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 인간이 아닌 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 생명연결 카운터를 올려놓는다.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: 당신이 조종하는 생명연결을 가진 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'"그녀가 보면, 나도 본다. 그녀가 맛보면, 나도 맛본다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fdf4b66-3af1-4aaf-8521-39ed23c73e88\', \'multiverseId\': 481160}, \'multiverseid\': 481160}, {\'name\': \'Mentora do Canino Crepuscular\', \'text\': \'Quando Mentora do Canino Crepuscular entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador de vínculo com a vida na criatura alvo que você controla que não seja um Humano.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla com vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"O que ela vê, eu vejo. O que ela prova, eu provo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa001d4f-4a42-4de7-b5b5-8ed489cea455\', \'multiverseId\': 481419}, \'multiverseid\': 481419}, {\'name\': \'Наставница Клыка Сумерек\', \'text\': \'Когда Наставница Клыка Сумерек выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон Цепи жизни на целевое не являющееся Человеком существо под вашим контролем.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо с Цепью жизни под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«То, что она видит, вижу и я. То, что она пробует на вкус, пробую и я».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b665370-33f6-4b9d-aa2c-54470d10981a\', \'multiverseId\': 481678}, \'multiverseid\': 481678}, {\'name\': \'暮牙明师\', \'text\': \'当暮牙明师进战场时，在目标由你操控的非人类生物上放置一个系命指示物。\\n{1}{B}，{T}：在每个由你操控且具系命异能的生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「吾见彼之所见。吾尝彼之所尝。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=481937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'981af211-17bb-41bf-9244-e91264c026f6\', \'multiverseId\': 481937}, \'multiverseid\': 481937}, {\'name\': \'暮牙明師\', \'text\': \'當暮牙明師進戰場時，在目標由你操控的非人類生物上放置一個繫命指示物。\\n{1}{B}，{T}：在每個由你操控且具繫命異能的生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「吾見彼之所見。吾嘗彼之所嘗。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebac8818-2216-4655-8bd2-5306afa9b37c\', \'multiverseId\': 482196}, \'multiverseid\': 482196}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482550&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8796967d-765f-4850-95f7-e30ca240ce71', 'multiverseId': 482550}, 'multiverseid': 482550}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482565&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2bbf870-5b10-42cb-8f5c-473a1d2796ef', 'multiverseId': 482565}, 'multiverseid': 482565}, {'name': 'Plaine', 